('350caefe-1bbe-44f1-9442-84b93c730cec', 'Karan Randhawa', 'karan-randhawa', 'Karan Randhawa first discovered his love for the stage as a kid, taking part in bhangra competitions and school festivals. That early spark quickly turned into ambition, and by 2017 he made his official entry into the music scene with his debut single “5-7 Yaar.” The track instantly put him on the map, highlighting his vocal strength along with a naturally cool, confident persona that fans connected with.', '/uploads/1769593281663-kk.jpg', 'India', NULL, 'Karan Randhawa', NULL, '2026-01-28 08:02:27.318', '2026-01-28 09:41:23.256'),
