('09131dec-0c96-490c-bb97-1f349a1b15ed', 'Punjabi', 'punjabi', 'Punjabi Song Lyrics 2026 - Latest Hits | DJYoungster', 'Explore devotional song lyrics on DJYoungster. Find latest Bhajan, Aarti, Shabad, Sufi, Qawwali & spiritual songs lyrics in Hindi, Punjabi, Tamil & Telugu.', '2026-01-27 21:10:38.778', 'Welcome to the Punjabi Lyrics section on DJYoungster, your ultimate destination for the latest Punjabi song lyrics in 2026. Discover accurate lyrics of Punjabi hits, Romantic, Sad, Bhangra, and Party songs from top artists with Hindi translations and romanized text.', NULL),
