('a33433ee-1060-43f0-aef6-e9e648794ca6', 'English', 'english', 'English Song Lyrics 2026 - Latest Hits | DJYoungster', 'Explore English song lyrics 2026 on DJYoungster. Find latest Hollywood, Pop, Hip Hop, Rock & R&B song lyrics with translations and complete album tracklist.', '2026-01-28 11:39:14.763', 'Welcome to the English Lyrics section on DJYoungster, your go-to destination for the latest English song lyrics in 2026. Discover accurate lyrics of Hollywood hits, Pop, Hip Hop, Rock, R&B, EDM, and Country songs from top artists worldwide with translations and romanized text.', '/uploads/1771411402272-nick-jonas.webp'),
