('c97033c1-38a9-4e4a-b11e-4128cabd1c56', 'Holiday', 'holiday', 2014, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-08 13:48:52.669'),
('cc3a39c3-1e10-467a-b4be-dbaf97c07f6e', 'Viyaah Kartaare Da', 'viyaah-kartaare-da', 2026, 'Smeep Kang', '/uploads/1771849106858-Viyaah-Kartaare-Da-bd8024d0-00f7-11f1-9551-bb0131203dcc.webp', 'Viyaah Kartaare Da is this hilarious upcoming Punjabi rom-com where lazy Kartar fakes his cop dad\'s death to snag his job, only for total wedding chaos to erupt when dad wakes up pure family drama gold! Starring the ever-charismatic Gippy Grewal and the soulful Nimrat Khaira, it\'s got that perfect mix of laughter, love, and Punjabi wedding vibes that\'ll have you rolling in the aisles.', 'Gippy Grewal, Nimrat Khaira', NULL, NULL, ' Chanchal Dabra', 'Comedy', NULL, 'Viyaah Kartaare Da Songs Lyrics - DJYoungster', 'Explore Viyaah Kartaare Da movie song lyrics with meanings and translations on DJYoungster.', '2026-02-16 12:52:25.363'),
