('18815562-9766-4aa2-aca3-f9bab5f0cd5a', 'Jee Liya', 'jee-liya', 'Raat bhar, chal ke raat bhar\nYe kahaan main thehra\nDarbadar, ghooma darbadar\nHar jagah tha pehra\n\nJaaga, khud mein main hi jaaga\nDuniya bhar se bhaaga\nMera hai ye pal, ye pal, ye pal\n\nHoke riha, ye dil hai jee liya\nHoke riha, ye dil hai jee liya\nSapnon ka ghoont maine pee liya\nJee liya jee liya\n\nLafz, mile adhoore hain\nKhwaahishon ki dhund mein bhooli bisri hain\nDhun, shehron ki raaton ke\nBechainiyon ka raag goonji hai\n\nTaara, toota jab woh taara\nJebon mein bhar saara\nHaasil kar liya, liya, liya\n\nHoke riha, ye dil hai jee liya\nHoke riha, ye dil hai jee liya\nKhamoshiyon ko maine sun liya\nJee liya jee liya\nHaan jee liya jee liya\nJee liya\nHoke riha, ye dil hai jee liya\nHoke riha, ye dil hai jee liya', NULL, 'All night, wandering through the night\nWhere did I end up\nWandering homeless, roaming homeless\nThere was vigilance everywhere\n\nAwake, I awakened within myself\nRan away from the whole world\nThis moment is mine, this moment, this moment\n\nHaving surrendered, this heart has lived\nHaving surrendered, this heart has lived\nI drank the essence of dreams\nI lived, I lived\n\nWords come incomplete\nLost and forgotten in the search for desires\nThe melody of city nights\nThe song of restlessness echoes\n\nA star, when that star broke\nFilled my life completely\nI achieved it, achieved it, achieved it\n\nHaving surrendered, this heart has lived\nHaving surrendered, this heart has lived\nI listened to the silences\nI lived, I lived\nYes, I lived, I lived\nI lived\nHaving surrendered, this heart has lived\nHaving surrendered, this heart has lived', 'रात भर, चल के रात भर\nये कहाँ मैं ठहरा\nदरबदर, घूमा दरबदर\nहर जगह था पहरा\n\nजागा, खुद में मैं ही जागा\nदुनिया भर से भागा\nमेरा है ये पल, ये पल, ये पल\n\nहोके रिहा, ये दिल है जी लिया\nहोके रिहा, ये दिल है जी लिया\nसपनों का घूँट मैंने पी लिया\nजी लिया जी लिया\n\nलफ़्ज़, मिले अधूरे हैं\nख़्वाहिशों की धुंध में भूली बिसरी हैं\nधुन, शहरों की रातों के\nबेचैनियों का राग गूँजी है\n\nतारा, टूटा जब वो तारा\nजीवन में भर सारा\nहासिल कर लिया, लिया, लिया\n\nहोके रिहा, ये दिल है जी लिया\nहोके रिहा, ये दिल है जी लिया\nख़ामोशियों को मैंने सुन लिया\nजी लिया जी लिया\nहाँ जी लिया जी लिया\nजी लिया\nहोके रिहा, ये दिल है जी लिया\nहोके रिहा, ये दिल है जी लिया', 'ਰਾਤ ਭਰ, ਚਲ ਕੇ ਰਾਤ ਭਰ\nਇਹ ਕਿਥੇ ਮੈਂ ਠਹਰਿਆ\nਦਰਬਦਰ, ਘੂਮਿਆ ਦਰਬਦਰ\nਹਰ ਜਾਗਾ ਸੀ ਪਹਿਰਾ\n\nਜਾਗਾ, ਖੁਦ ਵਿੱਚ ਮੈਂ ਹੀ ਜਾਗਾ\nਦੁਨੀਆ ਭਰ ਤੋਂ ਭਾਗਿਆ\nਮੇਰਾ ਹੈ ਇਹ ਪਲ, ਇਹ ਪਲ, ਇਹ ਪਲ\n\nਹੋ ਕੇ ਰਿਹਾ, ਇਹ ਦਿਲ ਹੈ ਜੀ ਲਿਆ\nਹੋ ਕੇ ਰਿਹਾ, ਇਹ ਦਿਲ ਹੈ ਜੀ ਲਿਆ\nਸਪਨਾਂ ਦਾ ਘੁੰਟ ਮੈਂ ਪੀ ਲਿਆ\nਜੀ ਲਿਆ ਜੀ ਲਿਆ\n\nਲਫ਼ਜ਼, ਮਿਲੇ ਅਧੂਰੇ ਹਨ\nਖ਼ੁਆਹਿਸ਼ਾਂ ਦੀ ਧੁੰਦ ਵਿਚ ਭੁੱਲੀ ਬਿਸਰੀ ਹਨ\nਧੁਨ, ਸ਼ਹਿਰਾਂ ਦੀਆਂ ਰਾਤਾਂ ਦੀ\nਬੇਚੈਨੀਆਂ ਦਾ ਰਾਗ ਗੂੰਜਿਆ ਹੈ\n\nਤਾਰਾ, ਟੁੱਟਾ ਜਦ ਵੋ ਤਾਰਾ\nਜੀਵਨ ਵਿੱਚ ਭਰ ਸਾਰਾ\nਹਾਸਲ ਕਰ ਲਿਆ, ਲਿਆ, ਲਿਆ\n\nਹੋ ਕੇ ਰਿਹਾ, ਇਹ ਦਿਲ ਹੈ ਜੀ ਲਿਆ\nਹੋ ਕੇ ਰਿਹਾ, ਇਹ ਦਿਲ ਹੈ ਜੀ ਲਿਆ\nਖ਼ਾਮੋਸ਼ੀਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਮੈਂ ਸੁਣ ਲਿਆ\nਜੀ ਲਿਆ ਜੀ ਲਿਆ\nਹਾਂ ਜੀ ਲਿਆ ਜੀ ਲਿਆ\nਜੀ ਲਿਆ\nਹੋ ਕੇ ਰਿਹਾ, ਇਹ ਦਿਲ ਹੈ ਜੀ ਲਿਆ\nਹੋ ਕੇ ਰਿਹਾ, ਇਹ ਦਿਲ ਹੈ ਜੀ ਲਿਆ', '\"Jee Liya\" from the upcoming film Tu Yaa Main is a deeply introspective and poignant song that explores the journey of self-discovery and acceptance amidst life\'s uncertainties. The title itself translates to \"I lived,\" encapsulating the central theme of existence, resilience, and finding meaning in one\'s experiences.\n\nThe song opens with imagery of nocturnal wandering, where the protagonist reflects on being lost and displaced—\"Raat bhar, chal ke raat bhar / Ye kahaan main thehra\" (All night wandering, where did I end up). This sets the stage for a narrative of someone who has been adrift, searching for direction and belonging. The repeated references to homelessness and vigilance suggest a life marked by restlessness and constant movement, resonating with universal human experiences of displacement and uncertainty.\n\nThe core message emerges in the haunting refrain \"Hoke riha, ye dil hai jee liya\" (Having surrendered, this heart has lived). This phrase embodies the paradox of finding peace through surrender—the acceptance that one cannot control everything, yet life continues and meaning emerges. The song suggests that true living comes not from achieving grand ambitions, but from surrendering to one\'s circumstances and finding profound beauty in simplicity.\n\nThe lyrical imagery becomes increasingly poetic as it progresses. \"Sapnon ka ghoont maine pee liya\" (I drank the essence of dreams) and \"Khamoshiyon ko maine sun liya\" (I listened to the silences) convey a protagonist who has learned to extract nourishment from intangible experiences. The broken star metaphor—\"Taara, toota jab woh taara / Jebon mein bhar saara\"—suggests that even in loss and devastation, there\'s a strange completeness and fulfillment.\n\nCultural and emotional resonance permeate the song. Words come incomplete, desires remain unfulfilled, yet the urban nights echo with melancholic beauty. This reflects the Hindustani musical tradition\'s celebration of bittersweet emotions. The song ultimately conveys that life\'s value lies not in perfection or achievement, but in the honest experience of being alive, in surrendering to the moment, and in finding poetry within pain.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 162, 0, 'published', 'Jee Liya Lyrics & Meaning - Tu Yaa Main - DjYoungster', 'Jee Liya lyrics: \"Hoke riha, ye dil hai jee liya\" - Full song meaning, Hindi, Punjabi & English translation from Tu Yaa Main film - DjYoungster', '/uploads/1770962006310-size-xl.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Chakori Dwivedi', 'Adarsh Gourav, Aditya N', 'Adarsh Gourav, Lothika', 'Zee Music Company', NULL, NULL, 'Bejoy Nambiar', '2026-02-12 09:44:41.299', '2026-02-23 19:36:05.451', NULL, 'ab780197-4d71-4b20-b33f-cdc8f4bd6a12'),
