arly morning sleep\n\nWith good snakes, catching\n\nIf you come in the middle way\n\nWith good snakes, catching\n\nIf you come in the middle way\n\nWith village birds, catching\n\nI will fly high\n\nWith village birds, catching\n\nI will fly high\n\nWith good snakes, catching\n\nIf you come in the middle way\n\nWith village birds, catching\n\nIf you fly high\n\nWith village birds, catching\n\nIf you fly high\n\nWith red flowers, catching\n\nI will hang the red garland\n\nWith red flowers, catching\n\nI will hang the red garland\n\nWith red flowers, catching\n\nIf the red garland comes\n\nWith red flowers, catching\n\nIf the red garland comes\n\nBy digging the earth\n\nI will sprout the plants\n\nBy digging the earth\n\nI will sprout the plants\n\nBy digging the earth\n\nIf the plants sprout\n\nBy digging the earth\n\nIf the plants sprout\n\nWith black soil, catching\n\nI will cut that plant\n\nWith black soil, catching\n\nI will cut that plant\n\nIf you are the black soil\n\nI will become a golden bangle\n\nIf you are the black soil\n\nI will become a golden bangle\n\nOn the banyan tree\n\nI will create a swing\n\nOn the banyan tree\n\nI will create a swing\n\nOn the banyan tree sleep\n\nUnder the bottom tree, sleep\n\nUnder your shelter I sleep\n\nWhat blessing should I ask\n\nOn the banyan tree sleep\n\nUnder the bottom tree, sleep\n\nI will also be a fig tree\n\nI will bend as a stone pillar\n\nFor the brother coming next\n\nI will become eternal stone\n\nI will also be a fig tree\n\nI will bend as a stone pillar', 'गाँव में सोना\n\nजल्दी सुबह की नींद\n\nगाँव में सोना\n\nजल्दी सुबह की नींद\n\nअच्छे साँपों को पकड़कर\n\nमैं सुबह आऊँगा\n\nअच्छे साँपों को पकड़कर\n\nमैं सुबह आऊँगा\n\nगाँव में सोना\n\nजल्दी सुबह की नींद\n\nअच्छे साँपों को पकड़कर\n\nअगर तुम बीच रास्ते में आओ\n\nअच्छे साँपों को पकड़कर\n\nअगर तुम बीच रास्ते में आओ\n\nगाँव के पक्षियों को पकड़कर\n\nमैं ऊपर उड़ जाऊँगा\n\nगाँव के पक्षियों को पकड़कर\n\nमैं ऊपर उड़ जाऊँगा\n\nअच्छे साँपों को पकड़कर\n\nअगर तुम बी