('3b8eca41-6851-4aa2-8a19-6b9391261436', 'Tirkit Dha', 'tirkit-dha', 'Shakal Apsara\nHarkat Natraj\nPehnu Mai Aaj\nLashon Ka Taj\nKabre Bhi Khabri Hai\nKhatron Nagri Hai\nSabhyata Ka Chalra Hai Nanga Naach\n\nTirkit Dha\nTirkit Dha\nTirkit Dha\nTirkit Dha\nMuh Mat Chala\nMar Jayega Na\nTirkit Dha Tirkit Dha\nMuh Mat Chala\nMar Jayega Na\nTirkit Dha\nTirkit Dha\nChale Bas Bas\n\nRaj Karne Ki Neeti Hai\nAaj Ki Janta Sleepy Hai\nDesh Ka Taka Mazhab Ne Kata\nTukde Tukde Karaoke Hisson Mein Bata Rrah\nBahar Se Rakshak Andar Se Bhakshak\nNeeyat Kharab Par Culture Ke Shikshak\nSatte Pe Pushtaini Haq Aur Hum Inke\n\nRaaj Karnyaachi Neeti Aahe\nBolto Maaj\nKonnaachihi Bheeti Naahi\nLaaj Yenna bhaari Aahe\nMala Raag Aala Tar Body Naahi\nEk Don Teen Chaar\nAaplya Bhaucha Jayjaykar\nPaanch Chhe Saat Aath\nTujhya Aai Chi\n\nTirkit Dha\nTirkit Dha\nMuh Mat Chala\nMar Jayega Na\nTirkit Dha\nTirkit Dha\nMuh Mat Chala\nMar Jayega Na\nTirkit Dha\nTirkit Dha\nTirkit Tirkit Dha\n\nShakal Se Girgit Lag Raha\nKaunsa Bedi Kiski Lanka\nAaj Bajega Mera Danka\nShraavan Mahina Barish Dhan Ki\nMai Madari Tu Hai Monkey\nBaat Karu Mai Apne Man Ki\nFeeling Like Pradhan Mantri\n\nFeeling Like I Run This Country\nSmokin Opps And I Got Munchies\nAlways Eat But Im Still Hungry\nI Smell Blood I Get Thirsty\n\nTirkit Dha\nTirkit Dha\nMuh Mat Chala\nMar Jayega Na\nTirkit Dha Tirkit Dha\nMuh Mat Chala\nMar Jayega Na\nTirkit Dha\nTirkit Dha', NULL, 'A face like a celestial nymph.\nBut actions like the destroyer Lord Natraj.\nToday, I wear…\n…a crown made of corpses.\nEven the graves act as informants.\nThis is a city of dangers.\nCivilization is performing a shameless, naked dance.\n\nTirkit Dha.\nTirkit Dha.\nTirkit Dha.\nTirkit Dha.\nDon’t run your mouth.\nYou’ll get yourself killed, won’t you?\nTirkit Dha, Tirkit Dha.\nDon’t run your mouth.\nYou’ll get yourself killed, right?\nTirkit Dha.\nTirkit Dha.\nThat’s enough, stop.\n\nIt’s the policy of ruling.\nToday’s public is asleep at the wheel.\nReligion has torn apart the nation’s fabric.\nDividing it into fragments and pieces.\nProtectors on the outside, predators on the inside.\nTheir intentions are corrupt, yet they claim to teach culture.\nThey claim an ancestral right to power, and we belong to them.\n\nThis is the strategy of governance.\nArrogance is speaking.\nThere is no fear of anyone.\nShame is too heavy a burden for them.\nIf I get angry, there won’t be a body left.\nOne, two, three, four.\nHail our brother’s victory.\nFive, six, seven, eight.\nTo your mother’s…\n\nTirkit Dha.\nTirkit Dha.\nDon’t run your mouth.\nYou’ll get killed, won’t you?\nTirkit Dha.\nTirkit Dha.\nDon’t run your mouth.\nYou’ll die, right?\nTirkit Dha.\nTirkit Dha.\nTirkit Tirkit Dha.\n\nLooking like a chameleon by the face.\nWhich traitor, and whose kingdom is burning?\nToday, my drum of victory will sound.\nIt’s the holy month of Shraavan, raining wealth.\nI’m the ringmaster, you’re just the monkey.\nI speak my mind like a broadcast.\nFeeling like the Prime Minister.\n\nFeeling like I run this country.\nSmoking opposition and I got munchies.\nAlways eat but I’m still hungry.\nI smell blood, I get thirsty.\n\nTirkit Dha.\nTirkit Dha.\nDon’t run your mouth.\nYou’ll die, won’t you?\nTirkit Dha, Tirkit Dha.\nDon’t run your mouth.\nYou’ll die, right?\nTirkit Dha.\nTirkit Dha.', 'शकल अप्सरा\nहरकत नटराज\nपह्नु मैं आज\nलाशों का ताज\nकब्रें भी खबरी हैं\nखतरों नगरी है\nसभ्यता का चल रहा है नंगा नाच\n\nतिरकिट धा\nतिरकिट धा\nतिरकिट धा\nतिरकिट धा\nमुंह मत चला\nमर जाएगा ना\nतिरकिट धा तिरकिट धा\nमुंह मत चला\nमर जाएगा ना\nतिरकिट धा\nतिरकिट धा\nचले बस बस\n\nराज करने की नीति है\nआज की जनता स्लीपी है\nदेश का टका मजहब ने काटा\nटुकड़े टुकड़े कराओके हिस्सों में बांट रहा\nबाहर से रक्षक अंदर से भक्षक\nनीयत खराब पर कल्चर के शिक्षक\nसत्ता पे पुश्तैनी हक और हम इनके\n\nराज करण्याची नीती आहे\nबोलतो माज\nकोन्नाचीही भीती नाही\nलाज येन्ना भारी आहे\nमला राग आला तर बॉडी नाही\nएक दोन तीन चार\nआपल्या भावचा जयजयकार\nपांच छह सात आठ\nतुझ्या आई ची\n\nतिरकिट धा\nतिरकिट धा