('3e806a49-9c92-430f-972b-cd9dd84baac1', 'Teen Baan Ke Dhari', 'teen-baan-ke-dhari', 'Andheron ki nagri se, kaise main paar jaaun\nShyam ab lene aaja, hausla haar na jaaun\nTeen baan ke dhaari, teenon baan chalaao na\nMushkil mein hai daas tera, ab jaldi aao na\n\nHaare ke sahaare, mere haare ke sahaare\nHaare ke sahaare, meri haar haraao na\nTeen baan ke dhaari, teenon baan chalaao na\nMushkil mein hai daas tera, ab jaldi aao na\n\nToofanon ne gher liya, mujhe raah nazar na aave\nTum bin kaun mera jo, meri baanh pakad le jaave\nBhatak raha raahon mein, baba paar lagaao na\nTeen baan ke dhaari, teenon baan chalaao na\nMushkil mein hai daas tera, ab jaldi aao na\n\nKisko rishte ginvaun, kise jaat bataun main\nKya kya zakhm diye jag ne, kise ghaat dikhaun main\nBin kuch pooche Shyam hamara, kasht mitaao na\nTeen baan ke dhaari, teenon baan chalaao na\nMushkil mein hai daas tera, ab jaldi aao na\n\nAnjaani nagri mein sab, anjaane lagte hain\nHum to teri yaad mein, ro ro raatein jagte hain\nBehta in aankhon se baba, neer thamaao na\nTeen baan ke dhaari, teenon baan chalaao na\nMushkil mein hai daas tera, ab jaldi aao na\n\nKrishna ko jisne daan diya, us daani ke aage\nHumein suna teri naam liye se, sankat sab bhaage\nChotu ki vipda ko baba, aag lagaao na\nTeen baan ke dhaari, teenon baan chalaao na\nMushkil mein hai daas tera, ab jaldi aao na\n\nTeen baan ke dhaari, teenon baan chalaao na\nMushkil mein hai daas tera, ab jaldi aao na\nHaare ke sahaare, mere haare ke sahaare\nHaare ke sahaare, meri haar haraao na\nTeen baan ke dhaari, teenon baan chalaao na\nMushkil mein hai daas tera, ab jaldi aao na', NULL, 'From the city of darkness, how do I cross over?\nO Shyam, come and take me now, before I lose all courage.\nO bearer of three arrows, release all three arrows now,\nYour servant is in trouble, please come quickly now.\n\nYou are the support of the defeated, my only support.\nO support of the defeated, turn my defeat into victory.\nO bearer of three arrows, release all three arrows now,\nYour servant is in trouble, please come quickly now.\n\nStorms have surrounded me, I can’t see the path ahead.\nWithout You, who is mine to hold my hand and guide me?\nI wander lost on these paths, Baba, help me cross over.\nO bearer of three arrows, release all three arrows now,\nYour servant is in trouble, please come quickly now.\n\nTo whom should I count my relations, what identity should I show?\nWhat wounds the world has given me, to whom should I reveal them?\nWithout asking anything, O Shyam, remove my suffering.\nO bearer of three arrows, release all three arrows now,\nYour servant is in trouble, please come quickly now.\n\nIn this unknown land, everyone feels like a stranger.\nIn Your remembrance, I cry and stay awake all night.\nO Baba, stop the tears flowing from these eyes.\nO bearer of three arrows, release all three arrows now,\nYour servant is in trouble, please come quickly now.\n\nBefore the great giver who once gave to Krishna,\nIt is said that all troubles flee when Your name is taken.\nO Baba, set fire to Chotu’s misfortune.\nO bearer of three arrows, release all three arrows now,\nYour servant is in trouble, please come quickly now.\n\nO bearer of three arrows, release all three arrows now.\nYour servant is in trouble, please come quickly now.\nYou are the support of the defeated, my only support.\nO support of the defeated, turn my defeat into victory.\nO bearer of three arrows, release all three arrows now.\nYour servant is in trouble, please come quickly now.', 'अंधेरो की नगरी से कैसे मैं पार जाओ\nश्याम अब लेने आजा हौसला हार ना जाऊ\nश्याम आजा श्याम आजा श्याम आजा\nतीन बाण के धारी तीनो बाण चलाओ ना\nमुश्किल में है दास तेरा अब जल्दी आओ ना\nतीन बाण के धारी तीनो बाण चलाओ ना\nमुश्किल में है दास तेरा अब जल्दी आओ ना\nहारे के सहारे मेरे हारे के सहारे मेरी हार हराओ ना\nतीन बाण के धारी तीनो बाण चलाओ ना\nमुश्किल में है दास तेरा अब जल्दी आओ ना\nतीन बाण के धारी तीनो बाण चलाओ ना\nमुश्किल में है दास तेरा अब जल्दी आओ ना\nश्याम आजा श्याम 