life', 'तेरे ही सहारे सारे तारे\nचमके चमके रहते हैं\nतु जो कभी जाये कौन सिखाये\nदिल की कैसे सुनते हैं\n\nकभी जो हो मंज़िल ना आसान\nरंजिश कोई दरमियान\nख़त हैं जो तुझको लिखे\nशायद मिल ना सके\nखैर तु अब जो मिले सुन ले ये सदा\n\nकैसी दिल्लगी है तु\nकैसी बेबसी है तु\nमेरी ज़िंदगी है तु\nमेरी ज़िंदगी है तु\n\nआँखों की नमी है तु\nसब है पर कमी है तु\nमेरी ज़िंदगी है तु\nमेरी ज़िंदगी है तु\n\nरोते हो तुम जो हम घबरायें\nथम क्यों जाती धड़कनें\nहंसता रहे हर पल दर्द ना पाये\nछीन लूं तेरी उलझनें\n\nसोचूं जो खुद को बिन तेरे\nकैसे चलेंगे सिलसिले\nतुम से ही करता शुरू\nतुम पर ही सब खतम\nदिल जो करे कभी तो मिलना फिर वहां\n\nकैसी दिल्लगी है तु\nकैसी बेबसी है तु\nमेरी ज़िंदगी है तु\nमेरी ज़िंदगी है तु\n\nआँखों की नमी है तु\nसब है पर कमी है तु\nमेरी ज़िंदगी है तु\nमेरी ज़िंदगी है तु', 'ਤੇਰੇ ਹੀ ਸਹਾਰੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਤਾਰੇ\nਚਮਕੇ ਚਮਕੇ ਰਹਤੇ ਹੈਂ\nਤੂ ਜੋ ਕਭੀ ਜਾਏ ਕੌਨ ਸਿਖਾਏ\nਦਿਲ ਕੀ ਕੈਸੇ ਸੁਨਤੇ ਹੈਂ\n\nਕਭੀ ਜੋ ਹੋ ਮੰਜ਼ਿਲ ਨਾ ਆਸਾਨ\nਰੰਜਿਸ਼ ਕੋਈ ਦਰਮਿਆਨ\nਖਤ ਹੈਂ ਜੋ ਤੁਝਕੋ ਲਿਖੇ\nਸ਼ਾਇਦ ਮਿਲ ਨਾ ਸਕੇ\nਖੈਰ ਤੂ ਅਬ ਜੋ ਮਿਲੇ ਸੁਨ ਲੇ ਯੇ ਸਦਾ\n\nਕੈਸੀ ਦਿਲਲਗੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਕੈਸੀ ਬੇਬਸੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਮੇਰੀ ਜ਼ਿੰਦਗੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਮੇਰੀ ਜ਼ਿੰਦਗੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\n\nਆੰਖੋਂ ਕੀ ਨਮੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਸਬ ਹੈ ਪਰ ਕਮੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਮੇਰੀ ਜ਼ਿੰਦਗੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਮੇਰੀ ਜ਼ਿੰਦਗੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\n\nਰੋਤੇ ਹੋ ਤੁਮ ਜੋ ਹਮ ਘਬਰਾਏਂ\nਥਮ ਕਿਉਂ ਜਾਤੀ ਧੜਕਨੇਂ\nਹੰਸਤਾ ਰਹੇ ਹਰ ਪਲ ਦਰਦ ਨਾ ਪਾਏ\nਛੀਨ ਲੂੰ ਤੇਰੀ ਉਲਝਨੇਂ\n\nਸੋਚੂੰ ਜੋ ਖੁਦ ਕੋ ਬਿਨ ਤੇਰੇ\nਕੈਸੇ ਚਲੇਂਗੇ ਸਿਲਸਿਲੇ\nਤੁਮ ਸੇ ਹੀ ਕਰਤਾ ਸ਼ੁਰੂ\nਤੁਮ ਪਰ ਹੀ ਸਬ ਖਤਮ\nਦਿਲ ਜੋ ਕਰੇ ਕਭੀ ਤੋ ਮਿਲਨਾ ਫਿਰ ਵਹਾਂ\n\nਕੈਸੀ ਦਿਲਲਗੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਕੈਸੀ ਬੇਬਸੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਮੇਰੀ ਜ਼ਿੰਦਗੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਮੇਰੀ ਜ਼ਿੰਦਗੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\n\nਆੰਖੋਂ ਕੀ ਨਮੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਸਬ ਹੈ ਪਰ ਕਮੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਮੇਰੀ ਜ਼ਿੰਦਗੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ\nਮੇਰੀ ਜ਼ਿੰਦਗੀ ਹੈ ਤੂ', 'The song \'Meri Zindagi Hai Tu\' performed by Asim Azhar and Sabri Sisters, is a heartfelt ode to a beloved person, portraying how integral they are to the singer\'s existence. The use of metaphoric language forms the core of the song, with the beloved being the foundation on which the singer\'s life sustains. The lyrics, \'Tere Hi Sahare Saare Taare,\' metaphorically liken the beloved\'s support to stars always shining brightly, suggesting stability and guidance.\n\nThe song explores the theme of a deep emotional connection, one that is profoundly interwoven with the singer\'s own identity. The line \'Kaisi Dillagi Hai Tu, Kaisi Bebasi Hai Tu\' highlights the paradox of being in love—one that gives immense joy yet leads to a vulnerability that the singer finds challenging. This leads to the repeated affirmation \'Meri Zindagi Hai Tu,\' unambiguously declaring the beloved as the vital essence of life.\n\nLove in this narrative is not simply about joy and companionship; it encompasses the complexities and fears of loss and separation. The lyrics \'If ever the destination is not easy, and there is some conflict between us\' delve into the inevitable trials every relationship faces. Yet there remains an unwavering hope for connection, despite the written letters that may not reach the recipient.\n\nThe intimacy is further portrayed through descriptions such as \'You are the moisture in my eyes,\' depicting the beloved as a significant emotional presence, even amid completeness, symbolizing an irreplaceable void that remains without them.\n\nUltimately, \'Meri Zindagi Hai Tu\' captures the myriad emotions of love—from joy, longing, anguish to redemption, painting a vivid picture of the depth of connection one feels towards another. Rooted deeply in South Asian musical traditions, the melodic narrative speaks universally, reflecting the universal language of love and longing.', NULL, NULL, 2025, 0, 346, 0, 'published', 'Meri Zindagi Hai Tu OST Lyrics - ASIM AZHAR & SABRI SISTERS [Meaning & Translation] - Djyoungster', 'Explore \'Meri Zindagi Hai Tu\' OST lyrics - \'Meri Zindagi Hai Tu, Meri Zindagi Hai Tu\'. Discover the song\'s deep meaning, lyrics, and English translation. - DjYoungster', '/uploads/1770983276371-Screenshot-2026-02-13-171738.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Asim Azhar, Nadeem Baig, Kumail Abbas', 'Asim Azhar', 'Asim Azhar, Sabri Sisters', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-13 11:44:05.364', '2026-02-23 19:36:17.641', NULL, NULL),
('8f893b5b-ecad-46f6-bba1-c2093f274fec', 'Masla', 'masla', 'Tu chhori haryanvi mai gabhru punjabi billo\nsade vich zor teri beauty behisabi billo\n\nAa kardi smile jehde maarke style ni\nTu hatt di ni lagda tu karegi kharabi billo\n\nhips dont lie jma lagg di shakira billo\nTere banne earpode mere dabbi assla ni\n\nese da e massla jo lakk tera patla ni\nese da e massla jo lakk tera patla ni\nDas dayi ae tu bhi pura kaida naal rakh langi\nese da e massla jo lakk tera patla ni\n\nFocus karein tor pe laadle tu high hona chavve mol pyar pe\nkaad leve jaan meri litt outfit jo ikk takk nazar jo pehne dior pe\n\nanswer to de deu ikk baar keh deu\ntanne mera nasha par manne teri tod ko neya\n\nchhore bus rehan de tu manne teri lodh koii neya\nchhore bus rehan de tu manne teri lodh koii neya\nmeri geleya chance na hath pair jodh koneya\nchhore bus rehan de …\n\nkadh dene jehde rakh di tu shakk goriye ni\ngabhru ne deni teri neend chakk goriye ni\n\nhan kar rabb banni kar ke chalaunia ni\nSunne khadak thode jind takk goriye ni\n\nPaani wale mudhe wangu paani sada bhareingi tu\nTu maar lai tu hawa par mittra te mareigi ni\n\nKar leya makeup te touchup bathera par\nPind reh ke mitran de chulha chownka kareingi tu\n\nAetki seyal saag tere hatho khana billo\nPathnia paathia tee chakna tu tassla ni\n\nese da e massla jo lakk tera patla ni\nese da e massla jo lakk tera patla ni\nDas dayi ae tu bhi pura kaida naal rakh langi\nese da e massla jo lakk tera patla ni\n\nHaye faida ko neya hand mat picche mere chhore tu\njall je ga laadle tu aayi ne mere dore tu\n\nvoltage high aa lapet deve banvle\nHusan ko jhel koni paave ga re dore tu\n\nMithi ko na chhore mai sugar cane wargi\nJhel na jo hove re mai aise pain wargi\n\nMera deputy sa tau tanne kaad lega ghar te\ntedi Hun ma bharatmala ki lane wargi\n\nAdh mat kariye na mere pichhe ladiye na\nChadhu jair teri ae mai mera antidote ko neya\n\nchhore bus rehan de tu manne teri lodh koii neya\nchhore bus rehan de tu manne teri lodh koii neya\nmeri geleya chance na hath pair jodh koneya\nchhore bus rehan de …\n\nSitt di ae shade par akha utte laavein na\nGabhru bhi chhoti moti shai nu hath paave na\n\nHo bera ko ni paata tere mann me ke laadle\ngol gol baat kare samjhio aave na\n\nMukkdi jo gall dasse big khaan haal dasse\ntenu billo udeek da ae vadda pind attla ni\n\nese da e massla jo lakk tera patla ni\nese da e massla jo lakk tera patla ni\n\nchhore bus rehan de tu manne teri lodh ko neya\nese da e massla jo lakk tera patla ni\nese da e massla jo lakk tera patla ni\n\nChhore bas rehan de…', NULL, 'You’re a Haryanvi girl, I’m a Punjabi guy\nBetween us, your beauty is unmatched\n\nWhen you smile with style\nIt feels like you’re about to cause trouble\n\nYour hips don’t lie, you look just like Shakira\nYou’ve got AirPods, I’ve got a weapon in my box\n\nThat’s the issue — your waist is slim\nTell me if you can truly handle things properly\n\nYou focus on your swag, you want high value for love\nYour tiny outfit takes my breath away\n\nJust give me an answer once\nYou’re addicted to me, but I don’t need you\n\nBoy, just stay away — I don’t need you\nNo chance with me, even if you beg\n\nIf you doubt me, I’ll cut you off\nThis Punjabi guy will steal your sleep\n\nSay yes, or I’ll take you like destiny\nYou’ll hear that sound for life\n\nYou’ll live in the village and handle the kitchen\nI’ll eat mustard greens cooked by your hands this winter\n\nDon’t follow me, it’s useless\nYou’ll burn if you come near\n\nMy beauty is high voltage\nYou won’t be able to handle it\n\nI’m sweet like sugarcane\nIf you can’t handle me, I’m pain\n\nI’m crooked like a Bharatmala highway lane\nThere’s no antidote for me\n\nYou throw shade but don’t apply it to your eyes\nEven I don’t touch small things\n\nThe whole village waits for you\nThat’s the issue — your waist is slim', 'तू हरियाणवी लड़की है, मैं पंजाबी गबरू हूँ\nहम दोनों के बीच तेरी खूबसूरती का ज़ोर बेहिसाब है\n\nजब तू स्टाइल मारकर मुस्कुराती है\nतू हटती नहीं, लगता है कोई शरारत करेगी\n\nतेरे हिप्स झूठ नहीं बोलते, बिल्कुल शकीरा जैसी लगती है\nतेरे पास ईयरपॉड हैं, मेरे पास डिब्बे में हथियार है\n\nयही तो मसला है कि तेरी कमर पतली है\nयही तो मसला है कि तेरी कमर पतली है\nतू भी बता दे क्या पूरे नियम से निभा पाएगी\nयही तो मसला है कि तेरी कमर पतली है\n\nतू अपने स्टाइल पर ध्यान देती है, प्यार की कीमत ऊँची चाहती है\nतेरा छोटा सा आउटफिट मेरी जान ले लेता है, जब तू डियोर पहनती है\n\nएक बार जवाब तो दे दे\nतुझे मेरा नशा है, पर मुझे तेरी कोई ज़रूरत नहीं\n\nछोरे, रहने दे, मुझे तेरी कोई ज़रूरत नहीं\nमेरे साथ कोई मौका नहीं, हाथ-पैर जोड़ने से भी नहीं\n\nअगर तू शक करेगी तो निकाल दूँगा\nगबरू तेरी नींद उड़ा देगा\n\nहाँ कर दे, वरना रब की तरह बनाकर ले जाऊँगा\nथोड़ी खड़खड़ाहट सुनेगी उम्र भर\n\nपानी वाले घड़े की तरह तू पानी भरती रहेगी\nतू हवा में मार ले, पर दोस्तों पर असर नहीं होगा\n\nतूने मेकअप और टचअप बहुत किया\nपर गाँव में रहकर मेरे दोस्तों के लिए चूल्हा-चौका करेगी\n\nइस सर्दी तेरे हाथों का साग खाऊँगा\nपत्थर और लकड़ी उठाकर तसला भी उठाएगी\n\nयही तो मसला है कि तेरी कमर पतली है\n\nमेरे पीछे मत पड़, फायदा नहीं होगा\nमेरे पास आई तो जल जाएगी\n\nतेरा हुस्न हाई वोल्टेज है\nकोई संभाल नहीं पाएगा\n\nमैं मीठी हूँ, गन्ने जैसी\nअगर झेल न पाए तो दर्द जैसी हूँ\n\nमेरा ताऊ डिप्टी है, तुझे घर से निकाल देगा\nमैं भारतमाला की लेन जैसी टेढ़ी हूँ\n\nमेरे पीछे मत लड़\nमैं तेरे लिए ज़हर हूँ, मेरा कोई एंटीडोट नहीं\n\nतू शेड डालती है पर आँखों पर नहीं लगाती\nगबरू भी छोटी-मोटी चीज़ को हाथ नहीं लगाता\n\nपता नहीं तेरे मन में क्या है\nतू गोल-गोल बात करती है\n\nबात खत्म होते ही हाल बता देना\nपूरा गाँव तेरा इंतज़ार कर रहा है\n\nयही तो मसला है कि तेरी कमर पतली है', 'ਤੂੰ ਹਰਿਆਣਵੀ ਕੁੜੀ ਏ, ਮੈਂ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਗਭਰੂ ਹਾਂ\nਸਾਡੇ ਵਿਚ ਤੇਰੀ ਸੋਹਣੀਅਤ ਦਾ ਜ਼ੋਰ ਬੇਹਿਸਾਬ ਏ\n\nਜਦ ਤੂੰ ਸਟਾਈਲ ਮਾਰ ਕੇ ਮੁਸਕਰਾਂਦੀ ਏ\nਲੱਗਦਾ ਏ ਤੂੰ ਕੋਈ ਸ਼ਰਾਰਤ ਕਰੇਂਗੀ\n\nਤੇਰੇ ਹਿਪਸ ਝੂਠ ਨਹੀਂ ਬੋਲਦੇ, ਬਿਲਕੁਲ ਸ਼ਕੀਰਾ ਵਰਗੀ ਲੱਗਦੀ ਏ\nਤੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਈਅਰਪੋਡ ਨੇ, ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਡੱਬੀ ਵਿਚ ਅਸਲਾ ਏ\n\nਏਹੀ ਤਾਂ ਮਸਲਾ ਏ ਤੇਰਾ ਲੱਕ ਪਤਲਾ ਏ\nਦੱਸ ਦੇ ਤੂੰ ਵੀ ਕਾਇਦੇ ਨਾਲ ਨਿਭਾ ਲੈਂਗੀ\n\nਤੂੰ ਆਪਣੇ ਟੋਰ \'ਤੇ ਫੋਕਸ ਕਰਦੀ ਏ, ਪਿਆਰ ਦੀ ਕੀਮਤ ਵੱਡੀ ਚਾਹੁੰਦੀ ਏ\nਤੇਰਾ ਛੋਟਾ ਆਉਟਫਿਟ ਮੇਰੀ ਜਾਨ ਕੱਢ ਲੈਂਦਾ ਏ\n\nਇੱਕ ਵਾਰ ਜਵਾਬ ਦੇ ਦੇ\nਤੈਨੂੰ ਮੇਰਾ ਨਸ਼ਾ ਏ, ਪਰ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਤੇਰੀ ਲੋੜ ਨਹੀਂ\n\nਛੋਰੇ ਰਹਿਣ ਦੇ, ਮੈਨੂੰ ਤੇਰੀ ਕੋਈ ਲੋੜ ਨਹੀਂ\nਮੇਰੇ ਨਾਲ ਮੌਕਾ ਨਹੀਂ, ਹੱਥ ਪੈਰ ਜੋੜ ਕੇ ਵੀ ਨਹੀਂ\n\nਜੇ ਤੂੰ ਸ਼ੱਕ ਕਰੇਂਗੀ ਤਾਂ ਕੱਢ ਦਿਆਂਗਾ\nਗਭਰੂ ਤੇਰੀ ਨੀਂਦ ਉਡਾ ਦੇਵੇਗਾ\n\nਹਾਂ ਕਰ ਦੇ, ਨਹੀਂ ਤਾਂ ਰੱਬ ਵਾਂਗ ਬਣਾਕੇ ਲੈ ਜਾਵਾਂਗਾ\nਥੋੜੀ ਖੜਕ ਉਮਰ ਭਰ ਸੁਣੇਂਗੀ\n\nਪਿੰਡ ਰਹਿ ਕੇ ਚੂਲ੍ਹਾ-ਚੌਂਕਾ ਕਰੇਂਗੀ\nਇਸ ਸਿਆਲ ਤੇਰੇ ਹੱਥਾਂ ਦਾ ਸਾਗ ਖਾਵਾਂਗਾ\n\nਮੇਰੇ ਪਿੱਛੇ ਨਾ ਆ, ਫਾਇਦਾ ਨਹੀਂ\nਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਆਈ ਤਾਂ ਸੜ ਜਾਵੇਂਗੀ\n\nਹਸਨ ਹਾਈ ਵੋਲਟੇਜ ਵਰਗਾ ਏ\nਕੋਈ ਝੱਲ ਨਹੀਂ ਸਕੇਗਾ\n\nਮੈਂ ਗੰਨੇ ਵਰਗੀ ਮਿੱਠੀ ਹਾਂ\nਜੇ ਨਾ ਝੱਲ ਸਕੇ ਤਾਂ ਦਰਦ ਵਰਗੀ ਹਾਂ\n\nਮੈਂ ਭਾਰਤਮਾਲਾ ਦੀ ਲੇਨ ਵਰਗੀ ਟੇਢੀ ਹਾਂ\nਮੇਰਾ ਕੋਈ ਐਂਟੀਡੋਟ ਨਹੀਂ\n\nਤੂੰ ਛਾਂ ਪਾਂਦੀ ਏ ਪਰ ਅੱਖਾਂ ਤੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਲਾਂਦੀ\nਗਭਰੂ ਵੀ ਛੋਟੀ ਮੋਟੀ ਚੀਜ਼ ਨੂੰ ਹੱਥ ਨਹੀਂ ਪਾਂਦਾ\n\nਸਾਰਾ ਪਿੰਡ ਤੇਰਾ ਇੰਤਜ਼ਾਰ ਕਰ ਰਿਹਾ ਏ\nਏਹੀ ਤਾਂ ਮਸਲਾ ਏ ਤੇਰਾ ਲੱਕ ਪਤਲਾ ਏ', '\"Masla\" is a playful, flirtatious duet that highlights the cultural clash and attraction between a Haryanvi girl and a Punjabi guy. The word \"masla\" (meaning \"problem/issue\") is used humorously — the recurring \"problem\" being that the girl\'s slim waist is too attractive and causes trouble.\nThe song alternates between the male and female perspectives. The guy tries to impress the girl with his swagger, while the girl confidently brushes him off, saying she doesn\'t need him. She\'s self-assured and independent, telling him to back off. He, in turn, teases her about eventually settling into village life despite her glamorous attitude.\nThe track blends Punjabi and Haryanvi dialects, which is central to its charm — the cultural banter between the two regions drives the humor and chemistry. References to Shakira, Dior, and modern lifestyle contrast with mentions of village traditions like cooking saag and doing household work, creating a fun tension between modern and traditional values.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 185, 0, 'published', 'Masla Lyrics - Hustinder [Meaning & Translation] - Him & Her', 'Read Masla Lyrics by Hustinder, Shiva Choudhary, and Khushi Baliyan with full original lyrics, Hindi translation, Punjabi (Gurmukhi) version, and English meaning. Explore the powerful blend of Punjabi swag and Haryanvi attitude in this trending song. Get accurate, easy-to-read lyrics and complete translations all in one place.', '/uploads/1770892700919-ab67616d0000b273126e25676a93b2080d0b0a69.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Big Khan', 'Showkidd', NULL, 'Tdot Records', 'Khushi Baliyan', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 11:02:38.422', '2026-02-23 18:46:08.030', 'db0a7de0-705f-4077-a481-59f219d8abe9', NULL),
('8fd4e0cb-19b3-4a9b-b156-fbf2d95d173f', 'Nazar', 'nazar', 'Kayia nu haasa tera shehad wangu lagge ni\nKinneya nu kude teri saadgi fabbe ni\n\nAdhya nu vakt koke tera paya ni\nBaki jeri kasar hai nakhra oh kadde ni\n\nHosh udd jande vekh mukhda tera\nKardiya follow tera makeup routine tera\n\nTere dwaale saari duniya hai ghumdi\nTu aawe te ruk je smaa\n\nNi Sohniye Nazar na layi tu lawa\nDhyan kude sareya da tere te hi aa', NULL, 'Your laughter seems as sweet as honey to many\nYour simplicity impresses countless ones\n\nMany have wasted half their lives chasing you\nWhatever arrogance remains, you\'ve already conquered it\n\nMy senses are blown away seeing your face\nEveryone follows your makeup routine\n\nThe whole world revolves around you\nWhen you arrive, time itself pauses\n\nOh beautiful, don\'t cast a glance\nEveryone\'s attention is already on you', 'कइयां नु हासा तेरा शेहद वांगु लग्गे नी\nकिन्नेयां नु कुड़े तेरी सादगी फब्बे नी\n\nअध्या नु वक्त कोके तेरा पाया नी\nबाकी जेरी कसर है नखरा ओह कड्डे नी\n\nहोश उड़ जाने वेख मुखड़ा तेरा\nकरदिया फोलो तेरा मेकअप रूटीन तेरा\n\nतेरे दवाले सारी दुनिया है घूमदी\nतु आवे ते रुक जे समा\n\nनी सोहणिये नज़र न लाई तु लवा\nध्यान कुड़े सरेआं दा तेरे ते ही आ', 'ਕਈਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਹਾਸਾ ਤੇਰਾ ਸ਼ਹਦ ਵਾਂਗੂ ਲੱਗੇ ਨੀ\nਕਿਨਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਕੁੜੇ ਤੇਰੀ ਸਾਦਗੀ ਫੱਬੇ ਨੀ\n\nਅੱਧਿਆ ਨੂੰ ਵਕਤ ਕੋਕੇ ਤੇਰਾ ਪਾਇਆ ਨੀ\nਬਾਕੀ ਜਿਹੜੀ ਕਸਰ ਹੈ ਨਖਰਾ ਉਹ ਕੱਢੇ ਨੀ\n\nਹੋਸ਼ ਉੱਡ ਜਾਣਦੇ ਵੇਖ ਮੁਖੜਾ ਤੇਰਾ\nਕਰਦੀਆ ਫੋਲੋ ਤੇਰਾ ਮੇਕਅਪ ਰੂਟੀਨ ਤੇਰਾ\n\nਤੇਰੇ ਦੁਆਲੇ ਸਾਰੀ ਦੁਨੀਆਂ ਹੈ ਘੁੰਮਦੀ\nਤੁ ਆਵੇ ਤਾ ਰੁਕ ਜੇ ਸਮਾ\n\nਨੀ ਸੋਹਣੀਏ ਨਜ਼ਰ ਨਾ ਲਈ ਤੂੰ ਲਵਾ\nਧਿਆਨ ਕੁੜੇ ਸਾਰਿਆਂ ਦਾ ਤੇਰੇ ਤੇ ਹੀ ਆ', 'The song \'Nazar\' by Armaan Gill and Arnaaz Gill explores themes of attraction, beauty, admiration, and the power of presence. The lyrics, delivered with a catchy rhythm, paint a vivid picture of a woman whose charm and allure are undeniable. The song begins by comparing her laughter to the sweetness of honey, suggesting that it captivates those around her. Her simplicity is likened to a spell, enchanting many admirers. These opening lines set the tone, emphasizing how her mere presence commands attention and evokes adoration.\n\nIn the narrative, the woman is portrayed as someone who has effortlessly conquered arrogance and seized the attention of others with her natural beauty and grace. The lines that describe viewers losing their senses upon seeing her face highlight a sense of awe that her beauty inspires. Her influence is so profound that even her makeup routine becomes a subject of emulation, illustrating how her style sets trends and influences those who look up to her.\n\nThe imagery of the world revolving around her underlines her centrality to the speaker\'s universe. The lyrics suggest that her arrival is akin to a pause in time, where everything waits on her acknowledgment. This creates an image of both power and stillness, showing her as a figure of immense influence and admiration. The playful warning in the lyrics \'Nazar na layi tu lawa\' (\'Don\'t cast a glance\') implies the profound impact a mere gaze from her can have, capable of captivating everyone around her.\n\nOverall, \'Nazar\' is a celebration of beauty and influence. It examines the magnetic pull of a woman\'s presence and how her simplicity and style mesmerize those who encounter her. This song resonates with anyone who has been drawn to someone seemingly perfect in their allure, leaving an indelible impression. With its lively tune and relatable theme, \'Nazar\' captures the timeless fascination with beauty and charm, making it a memorable listening experience.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 152, 0, 'published', 'Nazar Lyrics - Armaan Gill, Arnaaz Gill [Meaning & Translation] - DjYoungster', 'Explore the captivating \'Nazar\' lyrics by Armaan Gill and Arnaaz Gill featuring Tanu Grewal: \"Ni Sohniye Nazar na layi tu lawa,\" with full meaning and translation. - DjYoungster', '/uploads/1771746864168-ab67616d0000b273c585bc20cfc42d2a2c91b846.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Tanu Grewal', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-22 07:55:05.709', '2026-02-23 20:35:49.708', NULL, NULL),
('92ded8e3-f000-436a-bd7a-cf3702bbc032', 'Lost In You', 'lost-in-you', 'Haaye lag gi nazar teri\nDig gi si wali meri\nVe season a garmi da\nMurh di aagi nehri\n\nVe kado gal karni tu\nLanghdi umar meri\nVe onde saal le javi tu\nMain karlo teyari jedi\n\nVe saare kam kar chhadke\nVe rotiya khavau gurh nal\nO tadki boutique le lava\nDarji ni mainu thurhna\n\nVe akhiya ch tainu rakh la\nO larhda mere na surma\nVe jidne da dil le gya\nO lagde kite vi hunna\n\nHaaye jide akh larh gi jatta\nAape lot aaju surma\nVe hle takk chdea ni tu\nO sang ke piche nu mud na\n\nVe tu vi ta ni jida mainu saare lagde\nMainu bas mundean de laare lagda\nHaaye farzi ve jinne tere nal hunde a\nSukh nal deor mere saare lagde\n\nO ghar de mana la sonean\nMera ni kise ne sun na\nO jatt di pasand nu kehnda\nJatt ne viah ke murhna\n\nAkhiya ch tainu rakh la\n\nVe hun bebe nu vi shakk ho gya\nVaddi bhain bidka jayi le lag gi\nAggo nalo hor jyada rehndi hassdi\nSir utte chunni mere rehn lag gi\n\nVe msg ch saare dekh le\nTere pichhe peya sun na\nDikhda kitaba vich tu\nHundi padiya hun na\n\nAkhiya ch tainu rakh la', 'Haaye lag gi nazar teri\n→ Your eyes cast a spell on me\n\nDig gi si wali meri\n→ And my heart instantly fell\n\nVe season a garmi da\n→ It\'s the season of heat\n\nMurh di aagi nehri\n→ The rivers have started flowing again\n\nVe kado gal karni tu\n→ When will you finally talk to me?\n\nLanghdi umar meri\n→ My youth is passing by\n\nVe onde saal le javi tu\n→ If you agree, you’ll take away this year with me\n\nMain karlo teyari jedi\n→ I’ll prepare everything needed\n\nVe saare kam kar chhadke\n→ I’ll leave all my work aside\n\nVe rotiya khavau gurh nal\n→ And feed you rotis with jaggery\n\nO tadki boutique le lava\n→ And get outfits stitched from the boutique\n\nDarji ni mainu thurhna\n→ The tailor better not mess it up\n\nVe akhiya ch tainu rakh la\n→ I’ll keep you in my eyes\n\nO larhda mere na surma\n→ Even the kohl competes with you\n\nVe jidne da dil le gya\n→ The one who stole my heart\n\nO lagde kite vi hunna\n→ Looks unmatched anywhere else\n\nHaaye jide akh larh gi jatta\n→ The one whose eyes met the boy’s\n\nAape lot aaju surma\n→ Even the kohl surrendered\n\nVe hle takk chdea ni tu\n→ You still haven\'t given up yet\n\nO sang ke piche nu mud na\n→ Don’t turn back once you walk with me\n\nVe tu vi ta ni jida menu saare lagde\n→ You’re not like all the others for me\n\nMainu bas mundean de laare lagda\n→ I just see empty promises from guys\n\nHaaye farzi ve jinne tere nal hunde aa\n→ The ones with you seem fake\n\nSukh nal deor mere saare lagde\n→ My brother-in-laws look more genuine and peaceful\n\nO ghar de mana la sonean\n→ Convince your family, my love\n\nMera ni kise ne sun na\n→ No one listens to me\n\nO jatt di pasand nu kehnda\n→ They say the Jatt’s choice\n\nJatt ne viah ke murhna\n→ Is that the Jatt will marry and return with his bride\n\nAkhiya ch tainu rakhla\n→ I’ll keep you in my eyes\n\nVe hun bebe nu vi shakk ho geya\n→ Even mother is suspicious now\n\nVaddi bhain bidka jayi le lag gi\n→ The elder sister has become alert too\n\nAggo nalo hor jyada rehndi hassdi\n→ She keeps smiling more than before\n\nSir utte chunni mere rehn lag gi\n→ And now the veil stays on her head\n\nVe msg ch saare dekh le\n→ Check all the messages\n\nTere pichhe peya sun na\n→ I’ve been after you, listen\n\nDikhda kitaba vich tu\n→ I used to see you in my books\n\nHundi padiya hun na\n→ But I don’t study anymore\n\nAkhiya ch tainu rakhla\n→ I’ll keep you in my eyes', NULL, 'हाए लग गई नज़र तेरी\nडिग गई सी वाली मेरी\nवे सीज़न आ गर्मी का\nमुर दी आगी नेहरी\n\nवे कदो गल करनी तू\nलंघदी उमर मेरी\nवे ओंदे साल ले जावी तू\nमैं कर लूँ तैयारी जेड़ी\n\nवे सारे कम कार छोड़ के\nवे रोटियां खवाऊं गुड़ नाल\nओ तदकी बुटीक ले लवां\nदरज़ी नी मैंनू ठुर्णा\n\nवे अखियां में तैनू रख ला\nओ लड़दा मेरे नाल सुरमा\nवे जिद्ने दा दिल ले गया\nओ लगदे किते भी हुन्ना\n\nहाए जिदे अख लड़ गई जट्टा\nआपे लोट आजू सुरमा\nवे हले तक चढ़िया नी तू\nओ संग के पीछे मुड़ ना\n\nवे तू भी ता नी जिदा मैंनू सारे लगदे\nमैंनू बस मुंडियां दे लारे लगदा\nहाए फ़र्ज़ी वे जिन्ने तेरे नाल हुंदे आ\nसुख नाल देवर मेरे सारे लगदे\n\nओ घर दे मना ला सोणियां\nमेरा नी किसे ने सुन ना\nओ जट्ट दी पसंद नूं कहिंदा\nजट्ट ने ब्याह के मुड़ना\n\nअखियां में तैनू रख ला\n\nवे हुण बेबे नूं भी शक हो गया\nवड्डी बहिण बिदका जाई ले लग गई\nअग्गों नालों होर ज़्यादा रहंदी हस्दी\nसिर उत्ते चुन्नी मेरे रहिन लग गई\n\nवे मैसेज में सारे देख ले\nतेरे पीछे पेया सुन ना\nदिखदा किताबा विच तू\nहुंदी पढ़ाइयां हुण ना\n\nअखियां में तैनू रख ला', 'ਹਾਏ ਲਗ ਗੀ ਨਜ਼ਰ ਤੇਰੀ\nਡਿਗ ਗੀ ਸੀ ਵਾਲੀ ਮੇਰੀ\nਵੇ ਸੀਜ਼ਨ ਆ ਗਰਮੀ ਦਾ\nਮੁੜ ਦੀ ਆਗੀ ਨੇਹਰੀ\n\nਵੇ ਕਦੋ ਗੱਲ ਕਰਨੀ ਤੂੰ\nਲੰਘਦੀ ਉਮਰ ਮੇਰੀ\nਵੇ ਓਂਦੇ ਸਾਲ ਲੈ ਜਾਵੀ ਤੂੰ\nਮੈਂ ਕਰ ਲਵਾਂ ਤਿਆਰੀ ਜੇਹੀ\n\nਵੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਕੰਮ ਕੱਰ ਛੱਡ ਕੇ\nਵੇ ਰੋਟੀਆਂ ਖਵਾਉ ਗੁੜ ਨਾਲ\nਓ ਤਦਕੀ ਬੂਟੀਕ ਲੇ ਲਾਵਾਂ\nਦਰਜ਼ੀ ਨੀ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਠੁਰਣਾ\n\nਵੇ ਅੱਖੀਆਂ ‘ਚ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਰੱਖ ਲਾ\nਓ ਲੜਦਾ ਮੇਰੇ ਨਾਲ ਸੁਰਮਾ\nਵੇ ਜਿੰਨੇ ਦਾ ਦਿਲ ਲੈ ਗਿਆ\nਓ ਲਗਦੇ ਕਿੱਥੇ ਵੀ ਹੁੰਣਾ\n\nਹਾਏ ਜਿਦੇ ਅੱਖ ਲੜ ਗੀ ਜੱਟਾ\nਆਪੇ ਲੋਟ ਆਜੂ ਸੁਰਮਾ\nਵੇ ਹਲੇ ਤੱਕ ਚੜਿਆ ਨੀ ਤੂੰ\nਓ ਸੰਗ ਕੇ ਪਿੱਛੇ ਨੂੰ ਮੁੜ ਨਾ\n\nਵੇ ਤੂੰ ਵੀ ਤਾਂ ਨੀ ਜਿੰਨਾ ਮੈਂਨੂੰ ਸਾਰੇ ਲਗਦੇ\nਮੈਂਨੂੰ ਬਸ ਮੁੰਡਿਆਂ ਦੇ ਲਾਰੇ ਲਗਦਾ\nਹਾਏ ਫਰਜ਼ੀ ਵੇ ਜਿੰਨੇ ਤੇਰੇ ਨਾਲ ਹੁੰਦੇ ਆ\nਸੁੱਖ ਨਾਲ ਦਿਓਰ ਮੇਰੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਲਗਦੇ\n\nਓ ਘਰ ਦੇ ਮਨਾ ਲਾ ਸੋਣਿਆਂ\nਮੇਰਾ ਨੀ ਕਿਸੇ ਨੇ ਸੁਣ ਨਾ\nਓ ਜੱਟ ਦੀ ਪਸੰਦ ਨੂ ਕਹਿੰਦਾ\nਜੱਟ ਨੇ ਵਿਆਹ ਕੇ ਮੁੜਣਾ\n\nਅੱਖੀਆਂ ‘ਚ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਰੱਖ ਲਾ\n\nਵੇ ਹੁਣ ਬੇਬੇ ਨੂੰ ਵੀ ਸ਼ੱਕ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ\nਵੱਡੀ ਭੈਣ ਬਿਦਕਾ ਜਾਈ ਲੈ ਲਗ ਗੀ\nਅੱਗੋਂ ਨਾਲੋ ਹੋਰ ਜ਼ਿਆਦਾ ਰਹਿੰਦੀ ਹਸਦੀ\nਸਿਰ ਉੱਤੇ ਚੁੰਨੀ ਮੇਰੇ ਰਹਿਨ ਲਗ ਗੀ\n\nਵੇ ਮੈਸਜ ‘ਚ ਸਾਰੇ ਵੇਖ ਲੈ\nਤੇਰੇ ਪਿੱਛੇ ਪਿਆ ਸੁਣ ਨਾ\nਦਿੱਖਦਾ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ ਵਿੱਚ ਤੂੰ\nਹੁੰਦੀ ਪੜਾਈਆਂ ਹੁਣ ਨਾ\n\nਅੱਖੀਆਂ ‘ਚ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਰੱਖ ਲਾ', 'The song describes a girl teasing a boy while showing mutual interest. The boy explains how her gaze caught him, how time is passing, and how he is ready for marriage if she agrees. He imagines domestic life, shopping, and family reactions. The girl’s family starts noticing her feelings, and even books and studies become secondary as love consumes her thoughts. Throughout, he keeps expressing that he wants to keep her close, saying he would keep her in his eyes forever.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 214, 2, 'published', 'Lost In You Song Lyrics - Karan Randhawa with English Meaning', 'Lost In You Song Lyrics — Karan Randhawa is a romantic Punjabi track full of longing, chemistry, and youthful love. With clean Hindi lyrics and full English meaning for better understanding. “Akhiyan ch tainu rakh la”. this song beautifully captures how it feels to fall deeply for someone.', '/uploads/1769587742679-618376982-18558242455014796-774727480214196383-n.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0rh2olos_G4', 'https://open.spotify.com/track/2SNERefPoxQ6aGU5TzB32u', NULL, 'Fxrzzi', 'MNLTX', NULL, 'Jhankar Music', 'Karan Randhawa', NULL, 'Rajan Bir', '2026-01-28 08:13:08.092', '2026-02-23 20:17:27.243', NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `Song` (`id`, `title`, `slug`, `lyrics`, `lyricsRomanized`, `lyricsTranslated`, `lyricsHindi`, `lyricsPunjabi`, `meaning`, `duration`, `language`, `releaseYear`, `verified`, `views`, `likes`, `status`, `metaTitle`, `metaDescription`, `coverImage`, `youtubeUrl`, `spotifyUrl`, `appleMusicUrl`, `lyricist`, `composer`, `singers`, `label`, `starring`, `producer`, `director`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`, `albumId`, `movieId`) VALUES
('934b62fd-3ee4-453c-987c-f96cd43a5fd5', 'Left Behind', 'left-behind', 'Ho ucheyan chubareyan na bandi ni saddi\nSadde aam je gharan ton saare yaar ne\nNa iss layi rakaane bagg kattha kareya\nNi modda den nu bathere bas chaar ne\n\nHo bebe baapu khush, dass hor ki chahida\nKhoon vadh janda jadon dekhan hassde\nJinna ditta Malik ne, ok aa report\nDekh kise di chadhai taan ni machhde\n\nDo dangg sokhe khaane aa\nGhar phoonk ke kise da ghar bhare ni\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\n\nHo badeyan ne sitte, asi badeyan ne dobbe\nBedi Malik ne laa ditti paar ni\nBadeyan ne maaran nu kitti ardaas\nPaaye badeyan ne photoan te haar ni\n\nHo machhde shreek dekh maarde cheek\nSaale dollu wangu maanjh-maanjh rakhte\nDo-do munhe saale’an de ladhe dekh sapp\nDo saal’an ch munde ne fatte chakke\n\nMehnatan na din modeya\nHo jaa ke kise de rakaane pair fade ni\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\n\nHo beer di jhaag wangu baithe dekh anti\nSi jo tappda blood jehda thaar da\nKinneyan ne raahan vich kande si bichhaye\nDekh jatt ne suhaga kude maar ta\n\nHo maade dinaan na bade tauchan si adhe\nDekh patt ke jadaan cho jatt le gaya\nSadde vallon kude koi dass kami peshi\nKadd dineya fark je koi reh gaya\n\nJe payi lod, vaaj maar layi\nKadd dineya rakaane kamm adhe ni\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\n\nZafar te Sidhu baare puchhi lokkan kolo\nBillo laike dekhi mittran da naa ni\nJahaaj kude assi pind land hon laale\nJaande Jajjal Rohira dekh taan ni\n\nHo sikhran te guddi, doran Malik de hath\nDass ohde bina katte kehda dor ni\nNasha-patta billiye koi cham nu na laya\nChaddi ohde naam wali rehndi lor ni\n\nNi bol sadde eddan vajjde\nJo painde teen aale shed te aa gadde ni\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni', NULL, 'Uchcheyan chubareyan na bandi ni saddi\nWe don’t belong to high mansions or elite rooftops\n\nSadde aam je gharan ton saare yaar ne\nAll our friends come from simple, ordinary homes\n\nNa iss layi rakaane bagg kattha kareya\nWe never gathered crowds just to show off, girl\n\nNi modda den nu bathere bas chaar ne\nWhen it comes to support, four loyal ones are enough\n\nHo bebe baapu khush, dass hor ki chahida\nMy parents are happy—what more could I ask for\n\nKhoon vadh janda jadon dekhan hassde\nMy blood rushes with pride when I see them smiling\n\nJinna ditta Malik ne, ok aa report\nWhatever God has given me is more than enough\n\nDekh kise di chadhai taan ni machhde\nI don’t feel jealous seeing someone else rise\n\nDo dangg sokhe khaane aa\nI eat two simple meals in peace\n\nGhar phoonk ke kise da ghar bhare ni\nI won’t burn someone else’s house to build mine\n\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nThose who left during bad times\n\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\nTheir vehicles don’t stop at my place anymore\n\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nThose who walked away in hard times\n\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\nThey are no longer counted as friends\n\nHo badeyan ne sitte, asi badeyan ne dobbe\nI’ve seen great heights and deep lows\n\nBedi Malik ne laa ditti paar ni\nBut God steered my boat safely across\n\nBadeyan ne maaran nu kitti ardaas\nMany prayed for my downfall\n\nPaaye badeyan ne photoan te haar ni\nSome even placed garlands on my photos like I was gone\n\nHo machhde shreek dekh maarde cheek\nJealous relatives scream watching my success\n\nSaale dollu wangu maanjh-maanjh rakhte\nThey’re hollow, scraped empty like shells\n\nDo-do munhe saale’an de ladhe dekh sapp\nDouble-faced people exposed like snakes\n\nDo saalan ch munde ne fatte chakke\nWithin two years, the boys rose strong\n\nMehnatan na din modeya\nHard work changed my days\n\nHo jaa ke kise de rakaane pair fade ni\nI never begged at anyone’s feet\n\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nThose who left in bad times\n\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\nThey don’t stand with us today\n\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nThose who abandoned us\n\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\nThey’re not welcome anymore\n\nHo beer di jhaag wangu baithe dekh anti\nEnemies sat around like foam on beer\n\nSi jo tappda blood jehda thaar da\nTheir blood used to boil watching us\n\nKinneyan ne raahan vich kande si bichhaye\nMany laid thorns in our path\n\nDekh jatt ne suhaga kude maar ta\nBut the Jatt cut through them like a sickle\n\nHo maade dinaan na bade tauchan si adhe\nHard days broke many fake faces\n\nDekh patt ke jadaan cho jatt le gaya\nThe Jatt uprooted problems from the roots\n\nSadde vallon kude koi dass kami peshi\nFrom my side, name one mistake\n\nKadd dineya fark je koi reh gaya\nPoint it out if anything’s still left\n\nJe payi lod, vaaj maar layi\nIf you ever need help, just call\n\nKadd dineya rakaane kamm adhe ni\nI don’t leave work half-done, girl\n\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nThose who left during bad times\n\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\nThey no longer stand with us\n\nJo maade time gaye chhad ke bina\nThose who walked away\n\nOhna de yaaran de gadde khade ni\nThey’re not counted anymore\n\nZafar te Sidhu baare puchhi lokkan kolo\nAsk people about Zafar and Sidhu\n\nBillo laa ke dekhi mittran da naa ni\nYou’ll hear our name everywhere, girl\n\nJahaaj kude assi pind land hon laale\nWe land in our village like airplanes\n\nJaande Jajjal Rohira dekh taan ni\nThe whole Jajjal Rohira knows it\n\nHo sikhran te guddi, doran Malik de hath\nOur kite is high, but the string is in God’s hands\n\nDass ohde bina katte kehda dor ni\nWithout Him, no string can be cut\n\nNasha-patta billiye koi cham nu na laya\nI never touched drugs or intoxication\n\nChaddi ohde naam wali rehndi lor ni\nI stay high only on God’s name\n\nNi bol sadde e