('9e112f75-829c-466e-8cf9-140eedd25f96', 'Mannaru Vandhaaru', 'mannaru-vandhaaru', 'Mannaru vandhaaru\n\nIppo marriage kku body yethi\nJodiyathaan theduraaru ippo\n(Jodiyathaan theduraaru ippo)\nKalyana malaikkuthaan\nKaalam poan kalathila\nCouple ah thaan paakuraar ippo\n\nYe oorellaam paatharu\nOoyaama paathaaru\nOinji thenji kaachi pochu\nSaraku thaan illantaaru\n\nLove-uh naalum\nArrange-uh naalum\nHey love-uh naalum\nArrange-uh naalum\nLuck-uh venum maama\n\nHey catch vitta kaikkum\npakka match wifeum\nSathiayma thedunaalum kedaikathunga\nHey mokkaiyaana knife-um\nMarriage aan alife-um\nNichaiyaama onnuthaiyum seraikaathungha\n\nThaadiyil paadhi ippo vellai aachunga\nJodiya thedurathe thollai aachunga\nAda starting pola naan illa end la paarunga\nLastula thaan first varum STR-uh fanunnga\n\nLove-uh naalum\nArrange-uh naalum\nHey love-uh naalum\nArrange-uh naalum\nLuck-uh venum maama\n\nLuck-uh venum maama\nLuck-uh venum maama\nLuck-uh venum\nLuck-uh venum\nLuck-uh venum maama\nLuck-uh venum\nLuck-uh venum\nLuck-uh venum\nLuck-uh luck-uh luck-uh\nLuck-uh venum maama\n\nLove-uh naalum\nArrange-uh naalum\nHey love-uh naalum\nArrange-uh naalum\nLuck-uh venum maama', NULL, 'The match arrives\n\nNow for marriage the body has come\nSearching for a soulmate now\n(Searching for a soulmate now)\nWedding bells are ringing\nTime has passed in its season\nNow they see as a couple\n\nEveryone in the village has seen\nThey\'ve watched the entire night\nThings are getting mixed and confused\nThey just want alcohol\n\nWhether it\'s love\nOr arranged\nHey whether it\'s love\nOr arranged\nLuck is what we need brother\n\nHey if you catch with hands\nA perfect match wife\nEven searching with determination you won\'t find it\nHey with a crooked knife\nMarriage is a life\nYou can\'t escape from it even if you try\n\nHalf the hair has turned white now\nSearching for a match has turned me old\nI\'m not like in the beginning, just wait till the end\nAt the last, first comes the fan of S