('9f9984f0-42f3-4bd6-947f-63c3391c2433', 'Beautiful Day', 'beautiful-day', 'Din Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\nNi Ajj Din Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\nDin Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\nNi Ajj Din Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\n\nMatthi Matthi dhup aa Rakaane\nTadke Di chup aa Rakaane\nZulfan Chon Hawa Phire Langhdi\nJhoolde Ne Rukh Aa Rakaane\nTere Haase Naal Seene Pai Thand Varga\nNi Ajj Din Chadheya Ae\n\nDin Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\nNi Ajj Din Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\nDin Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\nNi Ajj Din Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\n\nPauna Vich Thoda Thoda Paani Ghuleya Lagge\nAkh Naal Akh Da Koi Haani Ghuleya\nRooh Vich Lagge Dil Thaani Ghuleya\nBani Cheteyan Ch Ishq Kahani Kole Aa\nJe Aun Jogiya Ton Lagge Nira Khand Varga Ve\nAj Din Chadheya Ae\n\nDin Chadheya Mere Rang Varga Ve\nAj Din Chadheya Mere Rang Varga\nDin Chadheya Mere Rang Varga Ve\nAj Din Chadheya Mere Rang Varga\n\nAjj Taan Dupehar Nu Dupehar Pair Bhull Gayi\nSuraj Te Jivein Chaanani Hi Dhull Gayi\nSuneya Si Din Raat Katthe Nahiyo Hunde\nPar Ajj Lagge Din Naal Raat Khul Gayi\nRaat Pain Ton Pehlan Nikle Eh Chann Varga\n‘Davy-Davy’ Kehndi Ae Ni Teri Vang Varga\nAj Din Chadheya Tere Rang Varga\n\nDin Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\nNi Ajj Din Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\nDin Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\nNi Ajj Din Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga', NULL, 'The day has risen, colored like you\nToday, the day has risen, colored like you\nThe day has risen, colored like you\nToday, the day has risen, colored like you\n\nSweet feelings of love blend\nThe early morning holds love intact\nThe wind moves gently through your hair\nThe trees are in full swing\nYour laughter brings a soothing coolness to my chest\nToday, the day has risen\n\nThe day has risen, colored like you\nToday, the day has risen, colored like you\nThe day has risen, colored like you\nToday, the day has risen, colored like you\n\nIn the breeze, a little water seems to dissolve\nAn eye-to-eye glance shares some compassion\nIn the soul, it feels like the heart is cradling feelings\nMemories are filled with love stories\nIf a sage comes, it seems as sweet as sugar\nToday, the day has risen\n\nThe day has risen, colored like me\nToday, the day has risen, colored like me\nThe day has risen, colored like me\nToday, the day has risen, colored like me\n\nToday, the afternoon has forgotten its own cycle\nJust as the sun is covered by moonlight\nI had heard that day and night never come together\nBut today, it seems the night has unfolded with the day\nBefore night could fall, the moon rose\nShe softly says, \'You are just like me\'\nToday, the day has risen, colored like you\n\nThe day has risen, colored like you\nToday, the day has risen, colored like you\nThe day has risen, colored like you\nToday, the day has risen, colored like you', 'दिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\nनि अज़्ज दिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\nदिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\nनि अज़्ज दिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\n\nमठी मठी तों प्यार रखाणे\nतड़के दी जो प्यार रखाणे\nज़ुल्फ़ां चों हवा फिरै लंघदी\nझूलदे ने रुख़ आ रखाणे\nतेरे हस्से नाल सीने पै ठंड वरगा\nनि अज़्ज दिन चढ़ेया ऐ\n\nदिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\nनि अज़्ज दिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\nदिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\nनि अज़्ज दिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\n\nपौना विच थोड़ा थोड़ा पानी घुलया लग्गै\nअख़ नाल अख़ दा कोई हाणी घुलया\nरूह विच लग्गै दिल ठाणी घुलया\nबनी चेतियाँ च इश्क़ कहानी कोले आ\nजे औण जोगिया तों लग्गे निरा खंड वरगा वे\nअज दिन चढ़ेया ऐ\n\nदिन चढ़ेया मेरे रंग वरगा वे\nअज दिन चढ़ेया मेरे रंग वरगा\nदिन चढ़ेया मेरे रंग वरगा वे\nअज दिन चढ़ेया मेरे रंग वरगा\n\nअज़्ज तां दुपहर नु दुपहर पैर भुल गयि\nसूरज ते जिवें चानणी ही धुल गई\nसुनेया सी दिन रात कते नहियों हुन्दे\nपर अज़्ज लग्गे दिन नाल रात खुल गई\nरात पैन तों पहलां निकले एह चन्न वरगा\n‘डेवी-डेवी’ कहंदी ऐ नि तेरी वंग वरगा\nअज दिन चढ़ेया तेरे रंग वरगा\n\nदिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\nनि अज़्ज दिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\nदिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा\nनि अज़्ज दिन चढ़ेया ऐ तेरे रंग वरगा', 'ਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਨੀ ਅੱਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜਿਹਾ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਨੀ ਅੱਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\n\nਮੱਠੀ ਮੱਠੀ ਧੁੱਪ ਆ ਰਖਾਣੇ\nਤੜਕੇ ਦੀ ਚੁੱਪ ਆ ਰਖਾਣੇ\nਜ਼ੁਲਫ਼ਾਂ ਚੋਂ ਹਵਾ ਫਿਰੇ ਲੰਘਦੀ\nਝੂਲਦੇ ਨੇ ਰੁੱਖ ਆ ਰਖਾਣੇ\nਤੇਰੇ ਹੱਸੇ ਨਾਲ ਸੀਨੇ ਪਈ ਠੰਢ ਵਰਗਾ\nਨੀ ਅੱਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ\n\nਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਨੀ ਅੱਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਨੀ ਅੱਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\n\nਪੌਣਾ ਵਿੱਚ ਥੋੜ੍ਹਾ ਥੋੜ੍ਹਾ ਪਾਣੀ ਘੁਲਿਆ ਲੱਗੇ\nਅੱਖ ਨਾਲ ਅੱਖ ਦਾ ਕੋਈ ਹਾਨੀ ਘੁਲਿਆ\nਰੂਹ ਵਿੱਚ ਲੱਗੇ ਦਿਲ ਠਾਨੀ ਘੁਲਿਆ\nਬਣੇ ਚੇਤਿਆਂ ਚ ਇਸ਼ਕ ਕਹਾਣੀ ਕੁਲੀਆਂ \nਜੇ ਆਉਣ ਜੋਗੀਆ ਤੂੰ ਲਗੇ  ਨਿਰਾ ਖੰਡ ਵਰਗਾ ਵੇ\nਅੱਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜਿਹਾ ਏ\n\nਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ  ਮੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ ਵੇ\nਅਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜਿਹਾ ਮੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ  ਮੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ ਵੇ\nਅਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਮੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\n\nਅੱਜ ਤਾ ਦੁਪਹਿਰ ਨੂੰ ਦੁਪਹਿਰ ਪੈਰ ਭੁੱਲ ਗਈ\nਸੂਰਜ ਤੇ ਜਿਵੇਂ ਚਾਨਣੀ ਹੀ ਡੁੱਲ ਗਈ\nਸੁਣਿਆ ਸੀ ਦਿਨ ਰਾਤ ਇਕੱਠੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੁੰਦੇ\nਪਰ ਅੱਜ ਲੱਗੇ ਦਿਨ ਨਾਲ ਰਾਤ ਖੁੱਲ ਗਈ\nਰਾਤ ਪੈਣ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਨਿਕਲੇ ਇਹ ਚੰਨ ਵਰਗਾ\n‘ਡੈਵੀ ਡੈਵੀ ’ ਕਹਿੰਦੀ ਏ ਨੀ ਤੇਰੀ ਵੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਅਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\n\nਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਨੀ ਅੱਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ\nਨੀ ਅੱਜ ਦਿਨ ਚੜ੍ਹਿਆ ਏ ਤੇਰੇ ਰੰਗ ਵਰਗਾ', 'The Punjabi song \"Beautiful Day\" by Wazir Patar and Raashi Sood evokes a sense of warmth and romance, reflecting the beauty and blissfulness of a day influenced by love. Through its poetic lyrics, the song narrates a story of how love transforms the ordinary into extraordinary, likening the rise of the day to the beloved\'s presence. The repeated line \"Din Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\" symbolizes the dawn being as vibrant as the color of love. This imagery signifies that the day itself feels different, enriched, because of the person they adore.\n\nThe lyrics convey how the early hours carry a love-filled tranquility, suggesting a renewal and fresh emotions as the day begins. The consistent mention of nature, such as \"Zulfan Chon Hawa Phire Langhdi\" and \"Jhoolde Ne Rukh Aa Rakhaane\", creates vivid imagery of a serene and picturesque setting, amplifying the purity and innocence of burgeoning love. This approach not only emphasizes particular moments shared between the couple but also underscores how nature itself seems to celebrate their union.\n\nFurther, the song touches on the interconnectedness of small experiences, like shared glances and soulful connections, to the greater narrative of love, as reflected in \"Akh Naal Akh Da Koi Haani Ghuleya.\" This connection is explained by the subtle yet impactful emotions that enhance everyday experiences for those in love, suggesting that even simple interactions become more meaningful.\n\nAs the song progresses, it delves into a deeper appreciation of time spent with loved ones, expressing a sense of timelessness and disconnect from the world. The lines \"Ajj Taan Dupehar Nu Dupehar Pair Bhull Gayi\" illustrate how love transcends regular time cycles, blending day with night and creating a seamless experience. Overall, \"Beautiful Day\" finds poetry in everyday life and immortalizes the feeling of love impacting everything around, making each day feel uniquely beautiful.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 0, 20, 0, 'published', 'Beautiful Day Lyrics - Wazir Patar, Raashi Sood [Meaning & Translation] - DjYoungster', 'Explore \'Beautiful Day\' by Wazir Patar & Raashi Sood: \'Din Chadheya Ae Tere Rang Varga\'. Discover the lyrics, meaning, and translation. - DjYoungster', '/uploads/1770982754438-beautiful-day-raashi-sood-wazir-patar-translation.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Davinder Davy', 'Wazir Patar', 'Raashi Sood, Wazir Patar', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-13 11:34:49.647', '2026-02-23 15:14:34.822', NULL, NULL),
('9fedfe43-506b-492c-8bca-e9cc133cb66a', 'Handprints', 'handprints', 'Took The Service Elevator\nLet Us Out On 8th\nMy Daughter And The Doorman\nGot A Secret Handshake\nGoing To The Tavern\nA Few Blocks Down The Road\nWe Could Get There Faster If We Took A Car\nSo We Don\'t\n\nHandprints On The Moment\nI\'m Holding Ya So Damn Tight\nIf We Could Run It Back, Run It Back\nYou Know I\'d Gladly Take It Twice\n\nBut I Know, Know In The Back Of My Mind\nWinter\'s A Season Away\nAnd You Hate The Cold, So I\'m Asking The Leaves If They\'d Kindly Not Change\nI Know, Know In The Back Of My Mind\nNothing Is Ever The Same\nIf I Could Take One Single Moment And Make It Stay Still In One Place\nIf I Could Slow Down Time\nI\'d Slow Down Mine With You\n\nWalk Around The River\nDo It While We Can\n\'Cause It Won\'t Be Too Long Now, Too Long\n\'Til It\'s Facetime \"Goodnight\"s At 9 A.M\n\nHandprints On The Moment\nGive Me More Time, More Time, I\'ll Spend It Right\nIf We Could Run It Back, Run It Back\nYou Know I\'d Gladly Take It Twice\n\nBut I Know, Know In The Back Of My Mind\nWinter\'s A Season Away\nAnd You Hate The Cold, So I\'m Asking The Leaves If They\'d Kindly Not Change\nI Know, Know In The Back Of My Mind\nNothing Is Ever The Same\nIf I Could Take One Single Moment And Make It Stay Still In One Place\nIf I Could Slow Down Time\nI\'d Slow Down Mine With You', NULL, NULL, 'सर्विस एलिवेटर लिया\n8वीं मंजिल पर उतरे\nमेरी बेटी और दरवाज़ा खोलने वाला\nगुप्त हैंडशेक मिला\nटेवर्न जाने के लिए\nकुछ ब्लॉक नीचे सड़क पर\nअगर हम कार लें तो वहां तेजी से पहंच सकते हैं\nइसलिए हम नहीं लेते\n\nपल पर हैंडप्रिंट\nमैं तुम्हें बहुत मजबूती से पकड़े हुए हूं\nअगर हम इसे वापस चला सकें\nतुम जानते हो कि मैं खुशी से दो बार लूंगा\n\nलेकिन मैं जानता हूं, मेरे दिमाग के पीछे जानता हूं\nसर्दी एक मौसम दूर है\nऔर तुम ठंड से नफरत करते हो, इसलिए मैं पत्तियों से पूछ रहा हूं कि क्या वे बदलना बंद कर सकती हैं\nमैं जानता हूं, मेरे दिमाग के पीछे जानता हूं\nकुछ भी कभी समान नहीं रहता\nअगर मैं एक पल ले सकूं और इसे एक जगह रोक सकूं\nअगर मैं समय को धीमा कर सकूं\nमैं अपना समय तुम्हारे साथ धीमा कर दूंगा\n\nनदी के चारों ओर घूमते हैं\nजब तक हम कर सकते हैं करो\nक्योंकि यह अब बहुत लंबा नहीं होगा\nजब तक यह सुबह 9 बजे फेसटाइम \"गुडनाइट\" न हो जाए\n\nपल पर हैंडप्रिंट\nमुझे और समय दो, और समय, मैं इसे सही तरीके से खर्च करूंगा\nअगर हम इसे वापस चला सकें\nतुम जानते हो कि मैं खुशी से दो बार लूंगा\n\nलेकिन मैं जानता हूं, मेरे दिमाग के पीछे जानता हूं\nसर्दी एक मौसम दूर है\nऔर तुम ठंड से नफरत करते हो, इसलिए मैं पत्तियों से पूछ रहा हूं कि क्या वे बदलना बंद कर सकती हैं\nमैं जानता हूं, मेरे दिमाग के पीछे जानता हूं\nकुछ भी कभी समान नहीं रहता\nअगर मैं एक पल ले सकूं और इसे एक जगह रोक सकूं\nअगर मैं समय को धीमा कर सकूं\nमैं अपना समय तुम्हारे साथ धीमा कर दूंगा', 'ਸਰਵਿਸ ਲਿਫਟ ਲਈ\n8ਵੀਂ ਮੰਜ਼ਿਲ \'ਤੇ ਸਾਨੂੰ ਬਾਹਰ ਨਿਕਲਿਆ\nਮੇਰੀ ਧੀ ਅਤੇ ਦਰਵਾਜ਼ਾ ਖੋਲਣ ਵਾਲਾ\nਗੁਪਤ ਹੈਂਡਸ਼ੇਕ ਮਿਲਿਆ\nਟਵਰਨ ਜਾਣ ਲਈ\nਕੁਝ ਬਲਾਕ ਸੜਕ ਹੇਠਾਂ\nਅਸੀਂ ਕਾਰ ਲਈ ਤੇਜ਼ੀ ਨਾਲ ਪਹੁੰਚ ਸਕਦੇ ਹਾਂ\nਤਾਂ ਅਸੀਂ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦੇ\n\nਪਲ \'ਤੇ ਹੈਂਡਪ੍ਰਿੰਟ\nਮੈਂ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਬਹੁਤ ਮਜ਼ਬੂਤੀ ਨਾਲ ਫੜ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ\nਜੇ ਅਸੀਂ ਇਸਨੂੰ ਵਾਪਸ ਚਲਾ ਸਕਦੇ\nਤੁਸੀਂ ਜਾਣਦੇ ਹੋ ਮੈਂ ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਨਾਲ ਦੋ ਵਾਰ ਲਵਾਂਗਾ\n\nਪਰ ਮੈਂ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹਾਂ, ਆਪਣੇ ਮਨ ਦੇ ਪਿਛਲੇ ਭਾਗ ਵਿੱਚ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹਾਂ\nਸਰਦੀ ਇੱਕ ਮੌਸਮ ਦੂਰ ਹੈ\nਅਤੇ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਠੰਡ ਤੋਂ ਨਫ਼ਰਤ ਕਰਦੇ ਹੋ, ਇਸ ਲਈ ਮੈਂ ਪੱਤਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਪੁੱਛ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ\nਮੈਂ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹਾਂ, ਆਪਣੇ ਮਨ ਦੇ ਪਿਛਲੇ ਭਾਗ ਵਿੱਚ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹਾਂ\nਕੁਝ ਵੀ ਕਦੇ ਇੱਕੋ ਜਿਹਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੁੰਦਾ\nਜੇ ਮੈਂ ਇੱਕ ਪਲ ਲੈ ਸਕਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਇਸਨੂੰ ਇੱਕ ਜਗ੍ਹਾ \'ਤੇ ਰੋਕ ਸਕਾਂ\nਜੇ ਮੈਂ ਸਮਾਂ ਹੌਲਾ ਕਰ ਸਕਾਂ\nਮੈਂ ਆਪਣਾ ਸਮਾਂ ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਨਾਲ ਹੌਲਾ ਕਰ ਦਿੰਦਾ\n\nਨਦੀ ਦੁਆਲੇ ਘੁੰਮਦੇ ਹਾਂ\nਜਦੋਂ ਤੱਕ ਅਸੀਂ ਕਰ ਸਕਦੇ ਹਾਂ ਕਰੋ\nਕਿਉਂਕਿ ਇਹ ਬਹੁਤ ਲੰਬਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੋਵੇਗਾ\nਜਦੋਂ ਤੱਕ ਸਵੇਰੇ 9 ਵਜੇ ਫੇਸਟਾਈਮ \"ਗੁਡ ਨਾਈਟ\" ਨਹੀਂ\n\nਪਲ \'ਤੇ ਹੈਂਡਪ੍ਰਿੰਟ\nਮੈਨੂੰ ਹੋਰ ਸਮਾਂ ਦਿਓ, ਹੋਰ ਸਮਾਂ, ਮੈਂ ਇਸਨੂੰ ਸਹੀ ਤਰੀਕੇ ਨਾਲ ਖਰਚ ਕਰਾਂਗਾ\nਜੇ ਅਸੀਂ ਇਸਨੂੰ ਵਾਪਸ ਚਲਾ ਸਕਦੇ\nਤੁਸੀਂ ਜਾਣਦੇ ਹੋ ਮੈਂ ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਨਾਲ ਦੋ ਵਾਰ ਲਵਾਂਗਾ\n\nਪਰ ਮੈਂ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹਾਂ, ਆਪਣੇ ਮਨ ਦੇ ਪਿਛਲੇ ਭਾਗ ਵਿੱਚ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹਾਂ\nਸਰਦੀ ਇੱਕ ਮੌਸਮ ਦੂਰ ਹੈ\nਅਤੇ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਠੰਡ ਤੋਂ ਨਫ਼ਰਤ ਕਰਦੇ ਹੋ, ਇਸ ਲਈ ਮੈਂ ਪੱਤਿਆਂ ਨੂੰ ਪੁੱਛ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ\nਮੈਂ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹਾਂ, ਆਪਣੇ ਮਨ ਦੇ ਪਿਛਲੇ ਭਾਗ ਵਿੱਚ ਜਾਣਦਾ ਹਾਂ\nਕੁਝ ਵੀ ਕਦੇ ਇੱਕੋ ਜਿਹਾ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੁੰਦਾ\nਜੇ ਮੈਂ ਇੱਕ ਪਲ ਲੈ ਸਕਾਂ ਅਤੇ ਇਸਨੂੰ ਇੱਕ ਜਗ੍ਹਾ \'ਤੇ ਰੋਕ ਸਕਾਂ\nਜੇ ਮੈਂ ਸਮਾਂ ਹੌਲਾ ਕਰ ਸਕਾਂ\nਮੈਂ ਆਪਣਾ ਸਮਾਂ ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਨਾਲ ਹੌਲਾ ਕਰ ਦਿੰਦਾ', '\"Handprints\" is a poignant exploration of the universal human desire to preserve fleeting moments of connection and intimacy. The song captures the bittersweet reality of spending time with a loved one while being acutely aware of its inevitable impermanence. Through vivid imagery and deeply personal lyrics, the artist articulates the tension between cherishing precious memories and the helplessness felt against the passage of time.\n\nThe narrative begins with intimate, everyday scenes—taking the service elevator, a secret handshake with a daughter and doorman, walking to a tavern—that establish a sense of closeness and shared experience. These mundane details transform into profound symbols of quality time together. The deliberate choice to walk rather than drive, expressed in \"We Could Get There Faster If We Took A Car, So We Don\'t,\" emphasizes the conscious decision to prioritize the journey and moments spent together over efficiency. This demonstrates a mature understanding that presence and attention are more valuable than speed.\n', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 102, 2, 'published', 'Handprints Lyrics Nick Jonas Meaning & Translation - DjYoungster', '\"Handprints\" lyrics by Nick Jonas & meaning explore fleeting moments of love. \"If I Could Slow Down Time, I\'d Slow Down Mine With You\" - discover complete lyrics, translation & deeper meaning - DjYoungster', '/uploads/1770451309778-unnamed.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Nick Jonas', 'Tommy English', NULL, 'Republic Records', 'Nick Jonas', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-07 08:04:37.413', '2026-02-23 19:48:50.576', '06e7a48d-0ce5-4e55-9cbb-00cd047f6b2b', NULL),
('a1b54d45-4b3e-4298-82f2-cfc9f1d0f704', 'Happy Budday', 'happy-budday', 'Ho.. haye\nOye happy budday to you..\nHappy happy budday to you\nArrey aire-gaire samjhe magarr..\nBas aashiqon pe rahe curfew\n\nO banno solah saalon ka tika laga doon\n(Tinak-dhin tinak-dhin, tinak-dhin tinak-dhin)\nOye bachu tere bachpan ka beema karan doon\n(Tinak-dhin tinak-dhin, tinak-dhin tinak-dhin)\nUmr chadhti rahegi, saal ghat\'te rahenge\nAur hoti rahegi guftguu…\n\nHappy budday to you..\nHappy-happy budday to you\nAire-gaire samjhe magar..\nBas aashiqon pe rahe curfew\n\nArrey kichad hai raste me\nPainche utha doon\n(Tinak-dhin tinak-dhin, tinak-dhin tinak-dhin)\nArrey sardi hai dhakkan me love-peg pila dun\n(Tinak-dhin tinak-dhin, tinak-dhin tinak-dhin)\nO badi bhi na hona warna\nGoonghat tale se bhej denge bana kar bahu..\n\nHappy budday to you..\nHappy-happy budday to you\nAire-gaire samjhe magar..\nBas aashiqon pe rahe curfew\n\nSadde waddey, sadde naal vaddey\nHappy shappy, happy shappy budday\nSadde waddey, sadde naal vaddey\nHappy shappy.. happy budday to you..\n\nO.. ek raati jo baarati tere ghar laaya koi\nGhanti baji re na band baje re na baaja\n(Haaye, haaye, haaye, haaye..)\nWo jo aaya mulaqaati\nKhaali haath aaya koi\nDoli uthe re na ghodi chali re na raja\n(Tinak-dhin tinak-dhin, tinak-dhin tinak-dhin)\nNa tu Laila thi\nNa tu Heer thi\nNa wo Ranjha tha, la la la la..\nPar Majnu tha hubahu\nOye happy, oye shappy\n\nHappy budday to you..\nHappy-happy budday to you\nAire-ghaire samjhe magar..\nBas aashiqon pe rahe curfew\n\nHappy birthday to you..\nHappy-happy budday to you\nAire-ghaire samjhe magar..\nBas aashiqon pe rahe curfew\n\nSadde vaddey, sadde naal vaddey\nHappy shappy, happy shappy budday\nSadde vaddey, sadde naal vaddey\nHappy shappy.. happy budday to you!', NULL, 'Ho.. hey\nOye happy birthday to you..\nHappy happy birthday to you\nListen others, but understand however..\nJust let there be a curfew on lovers\n\nO girl, let me put the mark on your sixteenth birthday\n(Tinak-dhin tinak-dhin, tinak-dhin tinak-dhin)\nOye child, let me insure your childhood\n(Tinak-dhin tinak-dhin, tinak-dhin tinak-dhin)\nAge will keep increasing, years will keep decreasing\nAnd conversations will continue…\n\nHappy birthday to you..\nHappy-happy birthday to you\nListen others, but understand however..\nJust let there be a curfew on lovers\n\nListen, there\'s mud on the road\nLet me lift the hem of your skirt\n(Tinak-dhin tinak-dhin, tinak-dhin tinak-dhin)\nListen, there\'s cold in the cover, let me give you a love drink\n(Tinak-dhin tinak-dhin, tinak-dhin tinak-dhin)\nO don\'t grow up or else\nWe\'ll send you from behind the veil as a bride..\n\nHappy birthday to you..\nHappy-happy birthday to you\nListen others, but understand however..\nJust let there be a curfew on lovers\n\nOur elders, our elders along with us\nHappy shappy, happy shappy birthday\nOur elders, our elders along with us\nHappy shappy.. happy birthday to you..\n\nO.. one night when a groom came to your house\nThe bell rang, the bandage didn\'t ring, the music didn\'t play\n(Haaye, haaye, haaye, haaye..)\nHe who came for a meeting\nCame with empty hands\nThe palanquin didn\'t rise, the horse didn\'t move, there was no glory\n(Tinak-dhin tinak-dhin, tinak-dhin tinak-dhin)\nYou weren\'t Laila\nYou weren\'t Heer\nHe wasn\'t Ranjha, la la la la..\nBut he was Majnu exactly\nOye happy, oye shappy\n\nHappy birthday to you..\nHappy-happy birthday to you\nListen others, but understand however..\nJust let there be a curfew on lovers\n\nHappy birthday to you..\nHappy-happy birthday to you\nListen others, but understand however..\nJust let there be a curfew on lovers\n\nOur elders, our elders along with us\nHappy shappy, happy shappy birthday\nOur elders, our elders along with us\nHappy shappy.. happy birthday to you!', 'हो.. हाये\nओये हैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें..\nहैप्पी हैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें\nअरे ऐरे-गैरे समझे मगर..\nबस आशिकों पे रहे कर्फ्यू\n\nओ बन्नो सोलह सालों का तिलक लगा दूँ\n(टिनक-धिन टिनक-धिन, टिनक-धिन टिनक-धिन)\nओये बचु तेरे बचपन का बीमा करान दूँ\n(टिनक-धिन टिनक-धिन, टिनक-धिन टिनक-धिन)\nउम्र चढ़ती रहेगी, साल घटते रहेंगे\nऔर होती रहेगी गुफ्तगू…\n\nहैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें..\nहैप्पी-हैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें\nऐरे-गैरे समझे मगर..\nबस आशिकों पे रहे कर्फ्यू\n\nअरे कीचड़ है रस्ते में\nपाँचे उठा दूँ\n(टिनक-धिन टिनक-धिन, टिनक-धिन टिनक-धिन)\nअरे सर्दी है ढक्कन में लव-पेग पिला दूँ\n(टिनक-धिन टिनक-धिन, टिनक-धिन टिनक-धिन)\nओ बड़ी भी न हो वरना\nगुंघट तले से भेज देंगे बना कर बहू..\n\nहैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें..\nहैप्पी-हैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें\nऐरे-गैरे समझे मगर..\nबस आशिकों पे रहे कर्फ्यू\n\nसड्डे वड्डे, सड्डे नाल वड्डे\nहैप्पी शैप्पी, हैप्पी शैप्पी बड़दिन\nसड्डे वड्डे, सड्डे नाल वड्डे\nहैप्पी शैप्पी.. हैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें..\n\nओ.. एक रात जो बारात तेरे घर लाया कोई\nघण्टी बजी रे न बंद बजे रे न बाजा\n(हाये, हाये, हाये, हाये..)\nवो जो आया मुलाकाती\nखाली हाथ आया कोई\nडोली उठे रे न घोड़ी चली रे न राजा\n(टिनक-धिन टिनक-धिन, टिनक-धिन टिनक-धिन)\nन तू लैला थी\nन तू हीर थी\nन वो राँझा था, ला ला ला ला..\nपर मजनू था हुबहु\nओये हैप्पी, ओये शैप्पी\n\nहैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें..\nहैप्पी-हैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें\nऐरे-गैरे समझे मगर..\nबस आशिकों पे रहे कर्फ्यू\n\nहैप्पी बर्थडे तुम्हें..\nहैप्पी-हैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें\nऐरे-गैरे समझे मगर..\nबस आशिकों पे रहे कर्फ्यू\n\nसड्डे वड्डे, सड्डे नाल वड्डे\nहैप्पी शैप्पी, हैप्पी शैप्पी बड़दिन\nसड्डे वड्डे, सड्डे नाल वड्डे\nहैप्पी शैप्पी.. हैप्पी बड़दिन तुम्हें!', 'ਹੋ.. ਹਾਏ\nਓਏ ਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ..\nਹੈਪੀ ਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ\nਅਰੇ ਐਰੇ-ਗੈਰੇ ਸਮਝੇ ਮਗਰ..\nਬਸ ਆਸ਼ਿਕਾਂ ਪੇ ਰਹੇ ਕਰਫਿਊ\n\nਓ ਬੱਨੋ ਸੋਲਾ ਸਾਲਾਂ ਕਾ ਤਿਲਕ ਲਗਾ ਦੂੰ\n(ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ, ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ)\nਓਏ ਬਚੁ ਤੇਰੇ ਬਚਪਨ ਕਾ ਬੀਮਾ ਕਰਾਂ ਦੂੰ\n(ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ, ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ)\nਉਮਰ ਚੜ੍ਹਤੀ ਰਹੇਗੀ, ਸਾਲ ਘਟਦੇ ਰਹਨਗੇ\nਅਤੇ ਹੋਂਦੀ ਰਹੇਗੀ ਗੁਫ਼ਤਗੂ…\n\nਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ..\nਹੈਪੀ-ਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ\nਐਰੇ-ਗੈਰੇ ਸਮਝੇ ਮਗਰ..\nਬਸ ਆਸ਼ਿਕਾਂ ਪੇ ਰਹੇ ਕਰਫਿਊ\n\nਅਰੇ ਕੀਚੜ ਹੈ ਰਸਤੇ ਵਿੱਚ\nਪਾਂਛਾ ਉਠਾ ਦੂੰ\n(ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ, ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ)\nਅਰੇ ਸਰਦੀ ਹੈ ਢੱਕਣ ਵਿੱਚ ਲਵ-ਪੇਗ ਪਿਲਾ ਦੂੰ\n(ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ, ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ)\nਓ ਵੱਡੀ ਭੀ ਨਾ ਹੋ ਵਰਨਾ\nਗੁੰਘਟ ਤਲੇ ਤੋਂ ਭੇਜ ਦੇਣਾ ਬਣਾ ਕੇ ਬਹੂ..\n\nਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ..\nਹੈਪੀ-ਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ\nਐਰੇ-ਗੈਰੇ ਸਮਝੇ ਮਗਰ..\nਬਸ ਆਸ਼ਿਕਾਂ ਪੇ ਰਹੇ ਕਰਫਿਊ\n\nਸਾਡੇ ਵੱਡੇ, ਸਾਡੇ ਨਾਲ ਵੱਡੇ\nਹੈਪੀ ਸ਼ੈਪੀ, ਹੈਪੀ ਸ਼ੈਪੀ ਬੁੱਦੇ\nਸਾਡੇ ਵੱਡੇ, ਸਾਡੇ ਨਾਲ ਵੱਡੇ\nਹੈਪੀ ਸ਼ੈਪੀ.. ਹੈਪੀ ਬੁੱਦੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ..\n\nਓ.. ਇੱਕ ਰਾਤ ਜੋ ਬਾਰਾਤ ਤੇਰੇ ਘਰ ਲਿਆਂਦਾ ਕੋਈ\nਘੰਟੀ ਵੱਜੀ ਰੇ ਨਾ ਬੰਦ ਵੱਜੇ ਰੇ ਨਾ ਬਾਜ਼ਾ\n(ਹਾਏ, ਹਾਏ, ਹਾਏ, ਹਾਏ..)\nਵੋ ਜੋ ਆਇਆ ਮੁਲਾਕਾਤੀ\nਖ਼ਾਲੀ ਹਾਥ ਆਇਆ ਕੋਈ\nਡੋਲੀ ਉਠੀ ਰੇ ਨਾ ਘੋੜੀ ਚਲੀ ਰੇ ਨਾ ਰਾਜ਼ਾ\n(ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ, ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ ਟਿਨਕ-ਧਿਨ)\nਨਾ ਤੂ ਲੈਲਾ ਸੀ\nਨਾ ਤੂ ਹੀਰ ਸੀ\nਨਾ ਵੋ ਰਾਂਝਾ ਸੀ, ਲਾ ਲਾ ਲਾ ਲਾ..\nਪਰ ਮਜਨੂ ਸੀ ਹੁਬਾਹੁ\nਓਏ ਹੈਪੀ, ਓਏ ਸ਼ੈਪੀ\n\nਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ..\nਹੈਪੀ-ਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ\nਐਰੇ-ਗੈਰੇ ਸਮਝੇ ਮਗਰ..\nਬਸ ਆਸ਼ਿਕਾਂ ਪੇ ਰਹੇ ਕਰਫਿਊ\n\nਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਥਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ..\nਹੈਪੀ-ਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ\nਐਰੇ-ਗੈਰੇ ਸਮਝੇ ਮਗਰ..\nਬਸ ਆਸ਼ਿਕਾਂ ਪੇ ਰਹੇ ਕਰਫਿਊ\n\nਸਾਡੇ ਵੱਡੇ, ਸਾਡੇ ਨਾਲ ਵੱਡੇ\nਹੈਪੀ ਸ਼ੈਪੀ, ਹੈਪੀ ਸ਼ੈਪੀ ਬੁੱਦੇ\nਸਾਡੇ ਵੱਡੇ, ਸਾਡੇ ਨਾਲ ਵੱਡੇ\nਹੈਪੀ ਸ਼ੈਪੀ.. ਹੈਪੀ ਬਰਡੇ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ!', 'Happy Budday is a poignant and satirical exploration of childhood, coming of age, and the societal constraints placed on young women, particularly within South Asian cultural contexts. The song cleverly uses the occasion of a birthday celebration to examine themes of protection, loss of innocence, and the inevitable restrictions that accompany growing up.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 164, 0, 'published', 'Happy Budday Lyrics - Kill Dil - English Meaning & Translation - DjYoungster', 'Happy Budday lyrics with English, Hindi, Punjabi translations. Read the meaning of \"Bas aashiqon pe rahe curfew\" & explore the song\'s themes. Full analysis - DjYoungster', '/uploads/1770553871520-size-xl-1747050638.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gulzar', 'Shankar-Ehsaan-Loy', 'Sukhwinder Singh, Shankar Mahadevan', 'YRF Music', NULL, NULL, 'Shaad Ali', '2026-02-07 14:00:16.848', '2026-02-23 19:47:28.697', NULL, 'c605375f-8135-4191-9626-888bb0b09816'),
('a242fa3d-4f76-42f8-a539-d91f26025b73', 'AA 23', 'aa-23', 'AA, AA\nI Say 23\nGoin’ On A Spree\nYou Just Set Me Free\n\nVIP, Walk In Easily\nWin So Casually\nLow-Key G, Locked In Mentally\nThat’s A Guarantee\n\nTalk To Me, Numbers Never Lie\nAdd It Up - That’s Me!\n\nTha Na Num Tha Num Tha Num Thaa\nJo Nu Tha Ree\nTha Na Num Tha Num Tha Num Thaa\nJo Nu Tha Ree\nTha Na Num Tha Num Tha Num Thaa\nJo Nu Tha Ree Thaa\n\nI Say 23\n\nStrive For Greatness', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 285, 2, 'published', 'AA 23 BGM Lyrics - Anirudh Ravichander', 'AA 23 BGM Lyrics AA, AA I Say 23 Goin’ On A Spree You Just Set Me Free VIP, Walk In Easily Win So Casually Low-Key G, Locked In Mentally That’s A Guarantee', '/uploads/1770011467579-ab67616d0000b273f8aa25d7dd200235302ffc28.webp', NULL, 'https://open.spotify.com/album/0Y6hWL8xxatoqyvsVy4Ge2', NULL, 'Hector Salamanca, Heisenberg', 'Anirudh Ravichander', NULL, NULL, 'Allu Arjun', NULL, 'Lokesh Kanagaraj', '2026-02-02 05:55:17.324', '2026-02-23 20:39:14.434', NULL, 'b507e26a-0f3b-4a39-9012-62e979cacbbd'),
('a2c29776-8219-4b7c-a9b9-35b95ee2c438', 'Mayajaalame', 'mayajaalame', 'Song Name: Mayajaalame from Sarvam Maya \n\nPokathe Mizhi Nananjidari Thoovathe\nMayathe Manam Pidayumoru Novotte\n\nKannadiyenne Pole Enne Kandathum\nNinte Kannilalle\n\nNjan Thaniye Ninnathum Koode Vannu Nee\nJeevane Kiyilille\n\nKoorirulin Padavil Munnil Minni Theliyan\nPonnin Tharathiri Aayi Nee\nVinnil Ninnum Parannen Nenjin Kombil Irunne\nMalakha Poovithale Nee\n\nMayajaalame Mayathengunnume\nMayajaalame Mayathengunnume\n\nPokathe Mizhi Nananjidari Thoovathe\nMayathe Manam Pidayumoru Novotte\n\nVeruthe Ormakal Mazha Nanayum Athil\nTheliyum Nin Mukham Katha Parayum\nVerpadin Venal Eriyunne Athil\nNeeyenna Thonnal Kanalakum\n\nOmal Thooval Chirakil Enne Chuttum Chiriye\nKanakattayi Marayathe\nKoode Koodi Thudichum Padipadi Paranjum\nMounam Mathram Pakarathe\n\nMayajaalame Mayathengunnume\nMayajaalame Mayathengunnume\n\nKoorirulin Padavil Munnil Minni Theliyan\nPonnin Tharathiri Aayi Nee\nVinnil Ninnum Parannen Nenjin Kombil Irunne\nMalakha Poovithale Nee\n\nPokathe Mizhi Nananjidari Thoovathe\nMayathe Manam Pidayumoru Novotte', NULL, 'Don’t leave, as my eyes get wet without shedding a tear.\nDon’t fade away, for this pain makes my heart throb.\n\nI saw myself just like a mirror,\nwasn’t it in your eyes?\n\nWhen I stood alone, you came along with me.\nMy life’s in your hands now, isn’t it?\n\nTo shine brightly on the steps of deep darkness,\nyou became a golden flame like a ‘tharathiri’ ‘star-light’.\nYou flew down from the sky and perched on the branch of my heart,\nyou’re an angelic flower petal.\n\nYou’re a magical illusion, don’t fade away anywhere.\nYou’re a magical illusion, don’t fade away anywhere.\n\nDon’t depart, while my eyes well up without shedding a tear.\nDon’t vanish, for this ache makes my heart flutter.\n\nMy memories are just getting soaked in the rain,\nand in it, your face appears and tells a story.\nThe summer of separation burns within me,\nand the feeling that you’re here becomes a burning ember.\n\nYour smile surrounds me on soft feathered wings,\ndon’t disappear like a golden dream.\nPulsating together, singing and telling your story,\ndon’t just leave me with silence.\n\nYou’re a magical illusion, don’t fade away anywhere.\nYou’re a magical illusion, don’t fade away anywhere.\n\nTo glow brightly upon the steps of deep darkness,\nyou became a golden flame like a ‘tharathiri’ ‘star-light’.\nYou glided down from the heavens to rest on my heart’s branch,\nmy angelic flower petal.\n\nPlease don’t go, as my eyes fill with tears that won’t fall.\nDon’t melt away, for this pain makes my soul ache.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2025, 0, 19, 0, 'draft', 'Mayajaalame', NULL, NULL, 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cq1M8GYb4Cc', NULL, NULL, 'Sooraj Santhosh, Manu Manjith, Justin Prabhakaran', 'Justin Prabhakaran', 'Justin Prabhakaran, Sooraj Santhosh', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-12 00:07:25.982', '2026-02-23 12:09:34.048', NULL, NULL),
('a72b3855-055c-4a48-96f7-3af8409b1e85', 'I Just Might', 'i-just-might', 'Intro\nOne, two, three, four\n\nHook\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\n\nVerse\nYou stepped inside with a vibe I ain’t never seen\nYes, you did, ooh\nSo girl, if you talk like you walk, come and talk to me\nBut look here\n\nPre-Chorus\nIt would break my heart, break my heart, break my heart\nIf I find out you can’t move\nYou better show me now, show me now, show me now\n’Cause when I take you to the floor, ooh, you gotta get down\nYou know what to do\n\nChorus\nHey, Mister DJ (oh-oh-oh)\nPlay a song for this pretty little lady (oh-oh-oh)\n’Cause if she dance as good as she look right now (oh-oh-oh)\nI just might, I just might make her my baby\nI just might make her my baby, hey\n\nHook\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\nI just might\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\nOh, I just might\n\nVerse\nBut first, may I just say that your face got me so intrigued?\nI’m so intrigued\nBut what good is beauty if your booty can’t find the beat?\nI don’t wanna know, girl, so please don’t do that to me\n\nPre-Chorus\n’Cause it would break my heart, break my heart, break my heart\nIf I find out you can’t move\nYou better show me now, show me now, show me now\n’Cause when I take you to the floor, ooh, you gotta get down\nYou know what to do\n\nChorus\nHey, Mister DJ (oh-oh-oh)\nPlay a song for this pretty little lady (oh-oh-oh)\n’Cause if she dance as good as she look right now (oh-oh-oh)\nI just might, I just might make her my baby\nI just might make her my baby, hey\n\nHook\nWhoo-whoo-whoo-whoo-whoo\nWhoo-whoo-whoo-whoo-whoo\n\nBridge\nThis the part where you break it all the way down, down, down, down\nThis the part where I turn you all the way around, ’round, ’round, ’round\nPut some spirit in it, put your heart into it, that’s all I need\nAnd if I like what I see, you’re coming home with me\n\nChorus (Repeat)\nHey, Mister DJ (oh-oh-oh)\nPlay a song for this pretty little lady (oh-oh-oh)\n’Cause if she dance as good as she look right now (oh-oh-oh)\nI just might, I just might make her my baby\nI just might make her my baby, hey\n\nOutro\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\nI just might\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\nOh, I just might', 'Intro\n\nEk, do, teen, chaar\n\nHook\n\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\n\nVerse\n\nTum andar aayi ek aisi ada ke saath\nJaisi maine pehle kabhi dekhi nahi\nHaan, sach mein\nToh ladki, agar tum chalti bhi\nWaise hi ho jaise tum baat karti ho\nToh aa kar mujhse baat karo\nPar zara yeh suno\n\nPre-Chorus\n\nMera dil toot jaayega, toot jaayega, toot jaayega\nAgar mujhe pata chala ke tum naach nahi sakti\nAbhi dikha do, abhi dikha do, abhi dikha do\nKyunki jab main tumhe dance floor par le jaaun\nToh tumhe poori tarah se naachna hoga\nTum jaanti ho kya karna hai\n\nChorus\n\nAe Mister DJ\nIs khoobsurat si ladki ke liye gaana chalao\nKyunki agar yeh utna hi achha naache\nJitni yeh abhi khoobsurat lag rahi hai\nToh shayad, haan shayad\nMain ise apni bana loon\nMain shayad ise apni bana loon\n\nHook\n\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\nMain shayad\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\nHaan, main shayad\n\nVerse\n\nPar pehle mujhe bas itna kehne do\nKe tumhara chehra mujhe bahut hi zyada pasand aa raha hai\nMain sach mein bahut intrigued ho gaya hoon\nPar khoobsurti ka kya faayda\nAgar tumhare kadam taal pakad hi na paayein\nMain yeh jaan’na nahi chahta, ladki\nIsliye please mere saath aisa mat karo\n\nPre-Chorus\n\nKyunki mera dil toot jaayega, toot jaayega, toot jaayega\nAgar mujhe pata chala ke tum naach nahi sakti\nAbhi dikha do, abhi dikha do, abhi dikha do\nKyunki jab main tumhe dance floor par le jaaun\nToh tumhe poori tarah se jhoomna hoga\nTum jaanti ho kya karna hai\n\nChorus\n\nAe Mister DJ\nIs pyaari si ladki ke liye gaana chalao\nKyunki agar yeh utna hi achha naache\nJitni yeh abhi khoobsurat lag rahi hai\nToh shayad, haan shayad\nMain ise apni bana loon\nMain shayad ise apni bana loon\n\nHook\n\nHoo-hoo-hoo-hoo-hoo\nHoo-hoo-hoo-hoo-hoo\n\nBridge\n\nYeh woh pal hai\nJab tum sab kuch khul kar dikhaati ho\nYeh woh pal hai\nJab main tumhe poori tarah se ghuma deta hoon\nIsmein jaan daal do, dil se karo\nBas itna hi mujhe chahiye\nAur agar mujhe jo dikhe woh pasand aa gaya\nToh tum mere saath ghar aaogi\n\nChorus (Repeat)\n\nAe Mister DJ\nIs khoobsurat si ladki ke liye gaana chalao\nKyunki agar yeh utna hi achha naache\nJitni yeh abhi khoobsurat lag rahi hai\nToh shayad, haan shayad\nMain ise apni bana loon\nMain shayad ise apni bana loon\n\nOutro\n\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\nMain shayad\nDoo-doo-doo-doo-doo-doo, doo-doo, doo\nHaan, main shayad', NULL, 'Intro\nएक, दो, तीन, चार\n\nHook\nडू-डू-डू-डू-डू-डू, डू-डू, डू\nडू-डू-डू-डू-डू-डू, डू-डू, डू\n\nVerse\nतुम अंदर आईं एक ऐसी अदा के साथ,\nजो मैंने पहले कभी नहीं देखी\nहाँ, सच में\nतो लड़की, अगर तुम चलती भी वैसा ही हो\nजैसा तुम बात करती हो, तो आकर मुझसे बात करो\nलेकिन ज़रा सुनो\n\nPre-Chorus\nमेरा दिल टूट जाएगा, टूट जाएगा, टूट जाएगा\nअगर पता चला कि तुम नाच नहीं सकती\nअभी दिखा दो, अभी दिखा दो, अभी दिखा दो\nक्योंकि जब मैं तुम्हें डांस फ्लोर पर ले जाऊँ\nतो तुम्हें पूरी तरह नाचना होगा\nतुम जानती हो क्या करना है\n\nChorus\nए मिस्टर डीजे\nइस खूबसूरत सी लड़की के लिए गाना बजाओ\nक्योंकि अगर ये उतना ही अच्छा नाचे\nजितनी ये अभी दिख रही है\nतो शायद, हाँ शायद\nमैं इसे अपनी बना लूँ\nमैं शायद इसे अपनी बना लूँ\n\nHook\nडू-डू-डू-डू-डू-डू, डू-डू, डू\nमैं शायद\nडू-डू-डू-डू-डू-डू, डू-डू, डू\nहाँ, मैं शायद\n\nVerse\nलेकिन पहले मुझे ये कहने दो\nकि तुम्हारा चेहरा मुझे बहुत आकर्षित कर रहा है\nमैं सच में मोहित हो गया हूँ\nपर खूबसूरती का क्या फायदा\nअगर तुम्हारे कदम ताल नहीं पकड़ पाते\nमैं जानना नहीं चाहता, लड़की\nइसलिए मुझसे ऐसा मत करो\n\nPre-Chorus\nक्योंकि मेरा दिल टूट जाएगा\nअगर पता चला कि तुम नाच नहीं सकती\nअभी दिखा दो\nक्योंकि जब मैं तुम्हें डांस फ्लोर पर ले जाऊँ\nतो तुम्हें पूरी तरह झूमना होगा\nतुम जानती हो क्या करना है\n\nChorus\nए मिस्टर 