for long.\n\nThe chorus \'Aaya mausam, dosti ka\' repeatedly highlights the arrival of this friendship season, suggesting a refreshment or a change in the dynamics of their lives. The verses mention how their acquaintance feels \'from before,\' signifying an inexplicable connection that transcends time and previous knowledge. This suggests the cultural belief in destinies intertwined by fate, a common motif in Indian narratives.\n\nIn the song, there\'s a playful exploration of whether what they share is love or merely a friendship made significant by their connection. Lines like \'Ka cheez hove hai pyaar\' bring humor into the narrative, as they ponder over the nature of love and friendship with a light-hearted tone. The repetitive \'la la la\' sections capture the naivety and joy often associated with young friendships, filled with spontaneity rather than structured expectations.\n\nThe song also addresses the societal perception of relationships, where a lack of formal recognition, \'Rishta nahin hai dono ko phir bhi / Baandhe koi dor hai,\' still binds them through an invisible thread. This reflects the belief in relationships built on intangible bonds like trust, understanding, and shared joy.\n\n\'Aaya Mausam Dosti Ka\' beautifully portrays the nuanced contours of friendship — exploring innocence, the blurring lines between friendship and love, and the unexpected impacts two people can have in each other\'s lives. It resonates with listeners who have experienced such formative and unexpected friendships, filled with warmth and connection.', NULL, NULL, 2016, 1, 382, 0, 'published', 'Aaya Mausam Dosti Ka Lyrics - Hindi Song [Meaning & Translation] - DjYoungster', '\'Aaya Mausam Dosti Ka\' captures the joyful surprise of friendship. \'Aaya mausam, dosti ka\' highlights this unexpected bond. Discover the lyrics, meaning, and translation - DjYoungster', '/uploads/1771513222108-downloaded.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Asad Bhopali', 'Ram Laxman', 'Lata Mangeshkar, Usha Mangeshkar, S. P. Balasubrahmanyam, Shailendra Singh', 'Saregama', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-19 15:08:22.071', '2026-02-23 20:06:18.481', NULL, NULL),
('ea244270-0195-4b63-ad8e-149a9a248227', 'Trendingg', 'trendingg', 'Chikani chaukari chikani chaukari\nHamako de zara dil mein naukari\nChikani chaukari mithai bekari\nTu insaaniya daaru ki factory\n\nMeri jawani garam garam biryani\nTujh mein dam hai to kha le\nMain to aisi hoon thoda idhar thoda udhar\nMeri kamar trending mein hai\n\nDing ding ding ding ding\nDigi digi ding digi digi ding digi digi ding\nDing ding ding ding\nDing ding ding ding ding\nDigi digi ding digi digi ding digi digi ding\nDing ding ding ding\n\n', NULL, 'Sleek trickster, sleek trickster\nGive me some job in your heart\nSleek trickster confectioner\'s delight\nYou are a human alcohol factory\n\nMy youth is hot hot biryani\nIf you have courage, then eat it\nI am just like this, a little here, a little there\nMy waist is in the trend\n\nDing ding ding ding ding\nDigi digi ding digi digi ding digi digi ding\nDing ding ding ding\nDing ding ding ding ding\nDigi digi ding digi digi ding digi digi ding\nDing ding ding ding', 'चिकनी चौकरी चिकनी चौकरी\nहमको दे जरा दिल में नौकरी\nचिकनी चौकरी मिठाई बेकरी\nतू इंसानिया दारू की फैक्ट्री\n\nमेरी जवानी गरम गरम बिरयानी\nतुझमें दम है तो खा ले\nमैं तो ऐसी हूँ थोड़ा इधर थोड़ा उधर\nमेरी कमर ट्रेंडिंग में है\n\nडिंग डिंग डिंग डिंग डिंग\nडिगी डिगी डिंग डिगी डिगी डिंग डिगी डिगी डिंग\nडिंग डिंग डिंग डिंग\nडिंग डिंग डिंग डिंग डिंग\nडिगी डिगी डिंग डिगी डिगी डिंग डिगी डिगी डिंग\nडिंग डिंग डिंग डिंग', 'ਚਿਕਨੀ ਚੌਕਰੀ ਚਿਕਨੀ ਚੌਕਰੀ\nਹਮਕੋ ਦੇ ਜਰਾ ਦਿਲ ਮੇਂ ਨੌਕਰੀ\nਚਿਕਨੀ ਚੌਕਰੀ ਮਿਠਾਈ ਬੇਕਰੀ\nਤੂ ਇਨਸਾਨਿਆਦਾਰੂ ਦੀ ਫੈਕਟਰੀ\n\nਮੇਰੀ ਜਵਾਨੀ ਗਰਮ ਗਰਮ ਬਿਰਯਾਨੀ\nਤੁਝਮੇਂ ਦਮ ਹੈ ਤੋ ਖਾ ਲੇ\nਮੈਂ ਤੋ ਐਸੀ ਹੂੰ ਥੋਡ਼ਾ ਇਦਰ ਥੋਡ਼ਾ ਉਦਰ\nਮੇਰੀ ਕਮਰ ਟ੍ਰੈਂਡਿੰਗ ਮੇਂ ਹੈ\n\nਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ\nਡਿਗੀ ਡਿਗੀ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿਗੀ ਡਿਗੀ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿਗੀ ਡਿਗੀ ਡਿੰਗ\nਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ\nਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ\nਡਿਗੀ ਡਿਗੀ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿਗੀ ਡਿਗੀ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿਗੀ ਡਿਗੀ ਡਿੰਗ\nਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ ਡਿੰਗ', 'The song \'ट्रेंडिंग Trendingg\' performed by Aishwarya Rangarajan and Sachin Basrur, features in the film \'Wild Tiger Safari (Kannada Movie).\' This vibrant track is infused with playful and charismatic energy, celebrating youthful spontaneity and confidence. In the opening lines, \'Chikani chaukari chikani chaukari\', the protagonist, characterized as a cunning yet charming individual, invites allure by commanding attention, seeking a place in the listener\'s heart with her astute and cheeky persona. The lyrics cleverly reference a fusion of sweetness and nostalgia through metaphors like \'mithai bekari\' and \'daaru ki factory,\' symbolizing a cocktail of innocence and youthful rebellion.<br><br>The line \'Meri jawani garam garam biryani\' encapsulates the protagonist\'s self-assurance and irresistible allure, likening her vibrant personality to the spicy and tempting dish, biryani. She teases with \'Tujh mein dam hai to kha le,\' challenging others to match her in zestful spirit. The repeated emphasis on \'Meri kamar trending mein hai\' serves as an anthem for self-love and confidence, portraying her as a trendsetter who enjoys being the center of attention, basking in her uniqueness and style.<br><br>Musically, the repetitive \'ding ding ding\' and \'digi digi ding\' segments add a catchy rhythm to the composition, ensuring it remains memorable and danceable. These playful interludes symbolize the liveliness and spontaneous nature of the song, making it an upbeat anthem appealing to younger audiences.<br><br>Set amidst the backdrop of a film featuring adventure and dynamic characters, \'Trendingg\' complements the narrative by interjecting moments of light-hearted bravado and celebration of individuality. The song\'s energy aligns with the movie\'s adventurous theme, where characters embrace life\'s wild and unexpected turns, mirrored in the lyrics\' vibrant and unpredictable nature.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 18, 0, 'published', 'Trendingg Lyrics - Wild Tiger Safari [Meaning & Translation] - DjYoungster', '\"Meri kamar trending mein hai\" from ट्रेंडिंग Trendingg captures youthful bravado from Kannada Movie Wild Tiger Safari. Explore the lyrics, meaning, and translation - DjYoungster.', '/uploads/1771848917999-wild.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pramod Maravante', 'Sachin Basrur', 'Aishwarya Rangarajan, Sachin Basrur', 'VK Films', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 12:14:40.431', '2026-02-23 19:22:32.978', NULL, '28e820d2-7c7b-439d-8829-b38dfde39b47'),
('ea3f1433-1056-43c6-81fe-4d7922ed55a5', 'Paheli Sa', 'paheli-sa', 'Paheli sa ban gaya hoon\nAakar mujhe tu khol de\nDeewana ho gaya hoon tera\nTu bhi kabhi to bol de\n\nPaheli sa ban gaya hoon\nAakar mujhe tu khol de\nDeewana ho gaya hoon tera\nTu bhi kabhi to bol de\n\nKab se tera intezaar hai mujhe\nTu bhi kuchh to soch le\nKaise main karoon tujhko bayaan\nTu bhi kabhi bol de\n\nBewafai na ho jaaye tujhse\nTu bhi kuchh to soch le\nPaheli sa ban gaya hoon\nAakar mujhe tu khol de\n\nChal, tujhe kuchh qisse main sunaoon\nAur tu bhi kuchh raaz khol de\nDeewana tera ho gaya hoon\nTu bhi to kuchh bol de\n\nO o o…\n\nPyaar—izhaar, iqraar, taqraar aur\nIntezaar se pehle\nJis muqaam par jaaoon main\nWo gali bhi teri ho\nAur tu bas ek baar to\nIs chaahat ka mol de\n\nBewafai ka ya ishq ki tabaahi ka\nManzar yun to dikhaata koi nahin\nPar jab tak saath hoon\nAankhen mila ke kuchh bol bhi de\n\nChaahoon agar sirf tumhein\nTo kya baat hogi\nTum bhi chaaho isi qadar\nTo kya baat hogi\n\nKuchh gunjaaishen hain\nShaayad judaai ki\nSab mita denge hum\nAb ye bhi manzoor hai mujhe', NULL, 'I have become a riddle\nCome and solve me\nI have gone mad for you\nWon\'t you speak to me sometime\n\nI have become a riddle\nCome and solve me\nI have gone mad for you\nWon\'t you speak to me sometime\n\nHow long have I been waiting for you\nThink about me a little\nHow can I express myself to you\nWon\'t you speak to me sometime\n\nMay I not face betrayal from you\nThink about me a little\nI have become a riddle\nCome and solve me\n\nCome, let me tell you some stories\nAnd you reveal some secrets too\nI have gone mad for you\nWon\'t you say something\n\nOh oh oh…\n\nLove, confession, acceptance, argument and\nWaiting—before all this\nWhichever place I reach\nMay that path also be yours\nAnd just once\nGive a price to this affection\n\nWhether it\'s betrayal or destruction of love\nNo one shows such a scene\nBut as long as I\'m with you\nJust look into my eyes and say something\n\nIf I only desire you\nWhat\'s the harm\nIf you desire me equally\nWhat\'s the harm\n\nThere are some whispers\nMaybe of separation\nWe will erase everything\nNow I accept this too', 'मैं एक पहेली बन गया हूँ\nआकर मुझे तू खोल दे\nदीवाना हो गया हूँ तेरा\nतू भी कभी तो बोल दे\n\nमैं एक पहेली बन गया हूँ\nआकर मुझे तू खोल दे\nदीवाना हो गया हूँ तेरा\nतू भी कभी तो बोल दे\n\nकब से तेरा इंतज़ार है मुझे\nतू भी कुछ तो सोच ले\nकैसे मैं करूँ तुझको बयान\nतू भी कभी बोल दे\n\nबेवफाई न हो जाये तुझसे\nतू भी कुछ तो सोच ले\nमैं एक पहेली बन गया हूँ\nआकर मुझे तू खोल दे\n\nचल, तुझे कुछ क़िस्से मैं सुनाऊँ\nऔर तू भी कुछ राज़ खोल दे\nदीवाना तेरा हो गया हूँ\nतू भी तो कुछ बोल दे\n\nओ ओ ओ...\n\nप्यार—इज़हार, इक़रार, तक़रार और\nइंतज़ार से पहले\nजिस मुक़ाम पर जाऊँ मैं\nवो गली भी तेरी हो\nऔर तू बस एक बार तो\nइस चाहत का मोल दे\n\nबेवफाई का या इश्क़ की तबाही का\nमंज़र यूँ तो दिखाता कोई नहीं\nपर जब तक साथ हूँ\nआँखें मिला के कुछ बोल भी दे\n\nचाहूँ अगर सिर्फ़ तुम्हें\nतो क्या बात होगी\nतुम भी चाहो इसी क़दर\nतो क्या बात होगी\n\nकुछ गुंजाइशें हैं\nशायद जुदाई की\nसब मिटा देंगे हम\nअब ये भी मंज़ूर है मुझे', 'ਮੈਂ ਇੱਕ ਪਹੇਲੀ ਬਣ ਗਿਆ ਹਾਂ\nਆ ਕੇ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਤੂ ਖੋਲ ਦੇ\nਦੀਵਾਨਾ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ ਹਾਂ ਤੇਰਾ\nਤੂ ਵੀ ਕਦੇ ਤਾ ਬੋਲ ਦੇ\n\nਮੈਂ ਇੱਕ ਪਹੇਲੀ ਬਣ ਗਿਆ ਹਾਂ\nਆ ਕੇ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਤੂ ਖੋਲ ਦੇ\nਦੀਵਾਨਾ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ ਹਾਂ ਤੇਰਾ\nਤੂ ਵੀ ਕਦੇ ਤਾ ਬੋਲ ਦੇ\n\nਕਦ ਤੋਂ ਤੇਰਾ ਇੰਤਜ਼ਾਰ ਹੈ ਮੈਨੂੰ\nਤੂ ਵੀ ਕੁਝ ਤਾ ਸੋਚ ਲੇ\nਕਿਵੇਂ ਮੈਂ ਕਰਾਂ ਤੈਨੂੰ ਬਿਆਨ\nਤੂ ਵੀ ਕਦੇ ਬੋਲ ਦੇ\n\nਬੇਵਫ਼ਾਈ ਨਾ ਹੋ ਜਾਵੇ ਤੈਨੋਂ\nਤੂ ਵੀ ਕੁਝ ਤਾ ਸੋਚ ਲੇ\nਮੈਂ ਇੱਕ ਪਹੇਲੀ ਬਣ ਗਿਆ ਹਾਂ\nਆ ਕੇ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਤੂ ਖੋਲ ਦੇ\n\nਚਲ, ਤੈਨੂੰ ਕੁਝ ਕਿੱਸੇ ਮੈਂ ਸੁਣਾਂ\nਤੇ ਤੂ ਵੀ ਕੁਝ ਰਾਜ਼ ਖੋਲ ਦੇ\nਦੀਵਾਨਾ ਤੇਰਾ ਹੋ ਗਿਆ ਹਾਂ\nਤੂ ਵੀ ਤਾ ਕੁਝ ਬੋਲ ਦੇ\n\nਓ ਓ ਓ...\n\nਪਿਆਰ—ਇਜ਼ਹਾਰ, ਇਕ਼ਰਾਰ, ਤਕ਼ਰਾਰ ਤੇ\nਇੰਤਜ਼ਾਰ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ\nਜਿਸ ਮੁਕ਼ਾਮ ਤੇ ਜਾਂ ਮੈਂ\nਓ ਗਲੀ ਵੀ ਤੇਰੀ ਹੋ\nਤੇ ਤੂ ਬਸ ਇੱਕ ਵਾਰ ਤਾ\nਇਸ ਚਾਹਤ ਦਾ ਮੋਲ ਦੇ\n\nਬੇਵਫ਼ਾਈ ਦਾ ਜਾਂ ਇਸ਼ਕ ਦੀ ਤਬਾਹੀ ਦਾ\nਮੰਜ਼ਰ ਯੂਂ ਤਾ ਦਿਖਾਂਦਾ ਕੋਈ ਨਹੀਂ\nਪਰ ਜਦ ਤਕ ਸਾਥ ਹਾਂ\nਅੱਖਾਂ ਮਿਲਾ ਕੇ ਕੁਝ ਬੋਲ ਵੀ ਦੇ\n\nਚਾਹਾਂ ਅਗਰ ਸਿਰਫ਼ ਤੁਸੀਂ\nਤਾ ਕੀ ਗੱਲ ਹੋਵੇਗੀ\nਤੁਸੀਂ ਵੀ ਚਾਹੋ ਇਸੇ ਕਦਰ\nਤਾ ਕੀ ਗੱਲ ਹੋਵੇਗੀ\n\nਕੁਝ ਗੁੰਜਾਈਸ਼ਾਂ ਹਨ\nਸ਼ਾਯਦ ਜੁਦਾਈ ਦੀਆਂ\nਸਭ ਮਿਟਾ ਦਿਆਂਗੇ ਹਮ\nਅਬ ਇਹ ਵੀ ਮੰਜ਼ੂਰ ਹੈ ਮੈਨੂੰ', '\"Paheli Sa\" is a deeply emotional Urdu-Hindi romantic composition that explores the complexities of unrequited or uncertain love through vivid metaphorical language. The song opens with the protagonist describing themselves as \"Paheli sa ban gaya hoon\" (I have become a riddle), establishing a central metaphor that runs throughout the piece. This riddle represents the emotional turmoil and confusion of loving someone who remains distant or indifferent.', NULL, 'Punjabi', 2026, 1, 165, 0, 'published', 'Paheli Sa Lyrics Mayur Daware Meaning & Translation - DjYoungster', 'Paheli Sa lyrics with meaning and translations. Read the song \"I have become a riddle, won\'t you speak to me by Mayur Daware\" - explore Hindi, Punjabi translations & detailed analysis.', '/uploads/1770467005485-2c5a6d45d6e7f95ab0284f52b87de8ce-1000x1000x1.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mayur Daware', NULL, 'Mayur Daware', 'Mayur Daware', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-07 12:23:06.042', '2026-02-23 19:36:16.096', NULL, NULL),
('ee72aa5c-5b8c-41c7-969a-2262f1ca1184', 'Let Me Know', 'let-me-know', 'intro\nWhoo, whoo, whoo, whoo\nWhoo, whoo, whoo, whoo\nWhoo, whoo, whoo, whoo\nWhoo, whoo, whoo, whoo\n\nverse\nRunnin’ to the checkered flag, runnin’ through the red light\nCatch me gunnin’, won’t pull over ’til I’m dead, right?\nRidin’ ’til the sunrise, ain’t care ’bout no bedtime\nAin’t gon’ trip on bitches ridin’ with me, let they head fly\n\nBetter know\nFrom Westside Atlanta up to Bed-Stuy\nAll the way to Crenshaw, I’ma handle mine, better know\nBig shit poppin’, ain’t no lil’ shit\nDroppin’ bags, it’s a lot to you, to me a lil’ bit, let ’em know\n\nBrown Chevy, .40 cal on my lap (uh-huh)\nReal dope boys in the trap (uh-huh)\nThe big yacht, ballin’ like a big shot\nNiggas on my tip, make room for your chick\n\nGotta let ’em know (ay)\nI don’t tongue-wrestle, I don’t lip-box (uh-huh)\nSolitaires — all I do is big rocks\nCame from dealin’ rock all the way to hit charts\nOn the throne, b*tch ain’t want no more — she can kick rocks\n\nLet ’em know\n\nhook\nMy foot up on the gas\nI’m blowin’ money fast (better know)\nI’m on these haters’ ass\nI know these niggas mad (better let ’em know)\n\nverse\nBig dog, always gettin’ bread, I ain’t never scared\nBig flex on a hater head — that’s what I’m standin’ on\nBig net, big check — we done did that\nPush your wig back, better give me respect and some more\n\nAtlanta know\n’Fore I would book a show for a grand or so\nI was sellin’ grams right on Campbell ’til them hammers blow\nLames sneak-dissin’ me, what you need a camera for?\nSinner hittas hittin’ hoes on centerfold — better know\n\nThey call it ballin’, we just call it livin’\nThey say you live and die by your decisions\nWell, I’ma push it to the limit, never mind the consequences\nInterfere — I’ma handle business, better let ’em know\n\nOn another level, my assets all put together\nHit the pedal — do two hundred everywhere I go\n(better know) and I stay fly just to show that they mad\nOn the throne, b*tch ain’t want no more — she can kick rocks\n\nLet ’em know\n\nhook\nMy foot up on the gas\nI’m blowin’ money fast (better know)\nI’m on these haters’ ass\nI know these niggas mad (better let ’em know)\n\nverse\nSkateboard P on the track\nLouis duffel bag, fifty racks (uh-huh)\nPoppin’ so obnoxious, I ain’t got no conscience\nPromote like I still got a pocket full of crack\n\nAll they do is fight for number two ’cause I’m the one (uh-huh)\nStill make a play with the one\nAll we know is success — hit her with some rich sex\nGood lookin’, your chick back — she forever mine ’til I let her go\n(on my leave)\n\nbridge\nBetter know, let-let-let ’em know\nBetter know, let-let-let ’em (on my leave)\nBetter know, let-let-let ’em know\nBetter know, let-let-let ’em (on my leave)\n\noutro\nMy foot up on the gas\nI’m blowin’ money fast (better know)\nI’m on these haters’ ass\nI know these niggas mad (better let ’em know)', 'intro\nOoh, ooh, ooh, ooh\nOoh, ooh, ooh, ooh\nOoh, ooh, ooh, ooh\nOoh, ooh, ooh, ooh\n\nverse\nCheckered flag tak bhaag raha hoon, red light cross kar raha hoon\nPakad sake to pakad, marne tak nahi rukne wala\nSooraj ugne tak ride karoon, kisey parwah bed-time ki\nJo saath baithi hai, bas sir hilati chale\n\nJaan lo\nWestside Atlanta se Bed-Stuy tak\nCrenshaw tak, apna kaam khud karta hoon, jaan lo\nBade kaam chal rahe, chhote nahi\nTujhe bag bhaari lage, mere liye chhota, bolo sabko\n\nBrown Chevy, gola godi mein (hun-hun)\nReal dope boy trap mein (hun-hun)\nBadi yacht, big shot jaisa game\nLog tang par, girl ko side kar\n\nSun lo\nZubaani ladayi nahi (hun-hun)\nSolitaire, bade patthar hi pehenta\nRock bechne se chart hit tak\nSinghasan par, jisko problem ho, raste naap le\n\nhook\nPair gas par\nPaise uda raha hoon (jaan lo)\nHaters ki kamar par\nPata hai wo jal rahe (bata do)\n\nverse\nBada dog, paise aa rahe, kabhi dar nahi\nSir par bada flex, wahi stand mera\nBadi net, bada check, sab kar diya\nRespect full chahiye, aur thoda aur\n\nAtlanta jaanta\nShow book hone se pehle, kuch hazaron mein\nCampbell par grams bechta, jab guns bolti\nLoose log sneak-diss, camera kyon?\nCenterfold hits, jaan lo\n\nBalling wo bolte, hum jeena\nDecisions se jeena-marna\nLimit tak dhakelunga, results ki parwah nahi\nBeech mein aaye to business settle\n\nEk aur level, assets jod chuke\nPedal daba ke 200 har jagah\n(jaan lo) ooncha chalta, jalane ko\nSinghasan par, problem ho to nikal\n\nhook repeat\n\nverse\nSkateboard P beat par\nLouis bag mein 50 racks (hun-hun)\nObnoxious flex, zameer nahi\nPromotion jaise jeb mein crack\n\nNumber two ke liye fight, number one main (hun-hun)\nPlay banana abhi bhi\nSuccess humara karma, rich sex ki chaabi\nGirl tumhari, meri jab tak chhod na doon', NULL, 'intro\nऊह, ऊह, ऊह, ऊह\nऊह, ऊह, ऊह, ऊह\nऊह, ऊह, ऊह, ऊह\nऊह, ऊह, ऊह, ऊह\n\nverse\nचेकर्ड फ्लैग तक भाग रहा हूँ, रेड लाइट क्रॉस कर रहा हूँ\nपकड़ सके तो पकड़, मरने तक नहीं रुकने वाला\nसूरज उगने तक राइड करूँ, किसे परवाह है बेडटाइम की\nजो भी मेरे साथ बैठी है, बस अपना सिर हिलाती चले\n\nजान लो\nवेस्ट साइड अटलांटा से लेकर बेड-स्टाय तक\nक्रेंशॉ तक, अपना काम खुद करता हूँ, जान लो\nबड़े काम चल रहे, छोटे-मोटे नहीं\nतुम्हें जो बैग भारी लगे, मेरे लिए छोटा सा, बता दो सबको\n\nब्राउन शेवी, गोला मेरी गोद में (हूँ-हूँ)\nरियल डोप बॉय ट्रैप में (हूँ-हूँ)\nबड़ी यॉट, बड़े शॉट की तरह खेल\nलोग मेरी टांग पर, अपनी लड़की को साइड कर\n\nसुन लो\nमैं ज़ुबानी लड़ाई नहीं करता (हूँ-हूँ)\nसॉलिटेयर, बड़े पत्थर ही पहनता\nरॉक बेचने से चार्ट हिट तक पहुँचा\nसिंहासन पर हूँ, जिसे दिक्कत है, रास्ता नाप ले\n\nhook\nपैर गैस पर\nतेज़ी से पैसे उड़ा रहा हूँ (जान लो)\nहेटर्स की कमर पर सवार\nऔर मुझे पता है वो जल रहे (सबको बता दो)\n\nverse\nबड़ा कुत्ता, पैसा आता रहे — कभी डरा नहीं\nसिर पर बड़ा फ्लेक्स, यही स्टैंड है मेरा\nबड़ी नेट, बड़ा चेक — ये सब हम कर चुके\nअगर इज्जत देनी है तो पूरी दे, और थोड़ा और\n\nअटलांटा जानता है\nशो बुक करने से पहले, कुछ हजारों में\nमैं कैंपबेल पर ग्रैम बेचता था, जब हथियार गरजते थे\nलूज लोग चोरी-छिपे बात करते, कैमरा क्यों चाहिए?\nसेंटरफोल्ड पर हिटर्स हिट कर रहे, जान लो\n\nवो इसे बॉलिन कहते, हम इसे जीना कहते\nकहते हैं फैसलों से जीते-मरते हैं\nमैं तो लिमिट तक धकेलूँगा, नतीजों की फिक्र नहीं\nबीच में आए तो बिजनेस निपटा दूँगा\n\nएक और लेवल पर, मेरी जायदादें जुड़ चुकी\nपेडल दबा के हर जगह 200 पर\n(जान लो) और दिखावे में उड़ता रहता, जिससे वो और जले\nसिंहासन पर हूँ, जिसे समस्या हो वो निकल ले\n\nhook\nपैर गैस पर\nतेज़ी से पैसा उड़ा रहा (जान लो)\nहेटर्स की कमर पर\nऔर मुझे पता है वो जल रहे (सबको बता दो)\n\nverse\nस्केटबोर्ड P बीट पर\nलुई बैग में पचास रैक (हूँ-हूँ)\nओब्नॉक्शस फ्लेक्स, ज़मीर नहीं\nऐसे प्रमोट जैसे अभी भी जेब में क्रैक हो\n\nवो नंबर टू पर लड़ाई करें, क्योंकि नंबर वन मैं हूँ (हूँ-हूँ)\nप्ले बनाना अभी भी आता है\nसक्सेस ही हमारा काम, रिच सेक्स की चाबी\nतुम्हारी लड़की वापस अच्छी दिख रही, जब तक मैं छोड़ न दूँ\n\nbridge\nजान लो, बता दो, बता दो\nजान लो, बता दो (मेरे जाने तक)\nजान लो, बता दो, बता दो\nजान लो, बता दो (मेरे जाने तक)\n\noutro\nपैर गैस पर\nपैसा तेज़ी से उड़ रहा (जान लो)\nहेटर्स की कमर पर\nऔर मुझे पता है वो जल रहे (बताने दो)', NULL, 'The song is a flex-heavy rap where T.I boasts about his hustle, street past, financial success, confidence, and dominance. He reflects on coming from the trap to chart success, living without fear, spending fast, staying ahead of haters, and being number one in his lane. The recurring theme is asserting status — letting others “know” who’s in control.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 170, 3, 'published', 'Let Me Know (2026) Song Lyrics - T.I with Hindi Meaning', 'Let Me Know by T.I meaning in Hindi, Roman transliteration, and English explanation. Understand the slang, flex, and story behind the lyrics in one place.', '/uploads/1769600223284-ab67616d0000b2734b4019f6b27b37d6b47af6b9.jpg', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FVz7T_nZAIw', NULL, NULL, 'Clifford Harris', 'Pharrell Williams', NULL, 'T.I.', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-01-28 11:37:06.602', '2026-02-23 20:23:19.365', 'f57e6e38-f7fd-4707-900e-c92934d610d2', NULL),
('ef9dc7e1-5672-4f6a-a711-103be69b4173', 'Maar Dihi Paala', 'maar-dihi-paala', 'Lahariya Uthata Kamariya Tutata\nLaagal Ba Aagi Raaja Bhitar Se Ghutata\n\nMaar Dihi Pala Badh Jaayi Pareshaniyan Ye Raniya\nBaruu Naya Abhi Kaniyan Ye Raniya\n\nBaani Hum Kaapat Tohra Lesle Ba Garmi\nPaar Kailu Dhani Aaj Saara Tu Besharmi\n\nBhaag Jaayi Thanda Anda Kha La Piya Jodi Jodi\nLe La Swaad Othlaliya Mein Bori Bori\n\nBhayil Badan Jaise Sharad Ke Paniyan Ye Raniya\nBaruu Naya Abhi Kaniyan Ye Raniya\n\nMaanelu Na Baat Tu Karelu Apne Mann Ke\nKhish Tu Badhaawat Baaru Prince Pawan Ke\n\nKarela Cheat Humse Bhayil Baara Cheater Piya\nHeater Jas Badhta Jawaniya Ke Meter Piya\n\nDaatla Par Chhaattaru Muski Chawaniyan Ye Raniya\nBaruu Naya Abhi Kaniyan Ye Raniya\n\nMaar Dihi Pala Badh Jaayi Pareshaniyan Ye Raniya\nBaruu Naya Abhi Kaniyan Ye Raniya', NULL, 'Waves rise and the waist bends\nThe royal fire burns from within\n\nKill me slowly, may these troubles end, o queen\nThe new rain is still falling, o queen\n\nI speak the truth to bear the heat of your love\nI have crossed over, my lord, you are shameless today\n\nThe cold wind blows, drink slowly, my beloved, sip by sip\nTaste the sweetness in the abundance, grain by grain\n\nThe body became like autumn water, o queen\nThe new rain is still falling, o queen\n\nDon\'t listen to words, follow your own heart\nYour pride increases with the prince Pawan\'s new rain\n\nYou cheated me and became a cheater, my love\nThe heater rises like youth\'s meter, my love\n\nOn the teeth, laughter spreads, mischief, o queen\nThe new rain is still falling, o queen\n\nKill me slowly, may these troubles end, o queen\nThe new rain is still falling, o queen', 'लहरिया उठता कमरिया टूटता\nलागल बा आगी राजा भीतर से घुटता\n\nमार दिही पाला बढ़ जाई परेशानियां ये रानिया\nबारू नया अभी कनियां ये रानिया\n\nबानी हम कापत तोहरा लेसले बा गर्मी\nपार कैलु धनी आज सारा तू बेशर्मी\n\nभाग जाई थंडा अंडा खा ला पिया जोड़ी जोड़ी\nले ला स्वाद ओठलालिया में बोरी बोरी\n\nभयिल बदन जैसे शरद के पनियां ये रानिया\nबारू नया अभी कनियां ये रानिया\n\nमानेलु न बात तु करेलु अपने मन के\nखिश तु बढ़ावत बारू प्रिंस पवन के\n\nकरेला चीट हमसे भयिल बारा चीटर पिया\nहीटर जस बढ़ता जवानिया के मीटर पिया\n\nदातला पर छत्तरु मुस्की चवनियां ये रानिया\nबारू नया अभी कनियां ये रानिया\n\nमार दिही पाला बढ़ जाई परेशानियां ये रानिया\nबारू नया अभी कनियां ये रानिया', 'ਲਹਰਿਆ ਉਠਦਾ ਕਮਰਿਆ ਟੁੱਟਦਾ\nਲਾਗਲ ਬਾ ਆਗੀ ਰਾਜਾ ਭਿਤਰ ਤੋਂ ਘੁੱਟਦਾ\n\nਮਾਰ ਦਿਹੀ ਪਾਲਾ ਬੜ੍ਹ ਜਾਈ ਪਰੇਸ਼ਾਨੀਆਂ ਏ ਰਾਨਿਆ\nਬਾਰੂ ਨਵਾ ਅਭੀ ਕਨਿਆਂ ਏ ਰਾਨਿਆ\n\nਬਾਨੀ ਹਮ ਕਾਪਤ ਤੋਹਰਾ ਲੇਸਲੇ ਬਾ ਗਰਮੀ\nਪਾਰ ਕੈਲੂ ਧਨੀ ਅਜ ਸਾਰਾ ਤੂ ਬੇਸ਼ਰਮੀ\n\nਭਾਗ ਜਾਈ ਥੰਡਾ ਅੰਡਾ ਖਾ ਲਾ ਪਿਆ ਜੋੜੀ ਜੋੜੀ\nਲੇ ਲਾ ਸਵਾਦ ਓਠਲਾਲਿਆ ਮੈਂ ਬੋਰੀ ਬੋਰੀ\n\nਭਯਿਲ ਬਦਨ ਜੈਸੇ ਸ਼ਰਦ ਕੇ ਪਨਿਆਂ ਏ ਰਾਨਿਆ\nਬਾਰੂ ਨਵਾ ਅਭੀ ਕਨਿਆਂ ਏ ਰਾਨਿਆ\n\nਮਾਨੇਲੂ ਨਾ ਬਾਤ ਤੂ ਕਰੇਲੂ ਅਪਨੇ ਮਨ ਕੇ\nਖਿਸ਼ ਤੂ ਬੜ੍ਹਾਵਤ ਬਾਰੂ ਪ੍ਰਿੰਸ ਪਵਨ ਕੇ\n\nਕਰੇਲਾ ਚੀਟ ਹਮਸੇ ਭਯਿਲ ਬਾਰਾ ਚੀਟਰ ਪਿਆ\nਹੀਟਰ ਜਸ ਬੜ੍ਹਦਾ ਜਵਾਨਿਆ ਕੇ ਮੀਟਰ ਪਿਆ\n\nਦਾਤਲਾ ਪਰ ਛੱਤਰੂ ਮੁਸਕੀ ਚਵਨਿਆਂ ਏ ਰਾਨਿਆ\nਬਾਰੂ ਨਵਾ ਅਭੀ ਕਨਿਆਂ ਏ ਰਾਨਿਆ\n\nਮਾਰ ਦਿਹੀ ਪਾਲਾ ਬੜ੍ਹ ਜਾਈ ਪਰੇਸ਼ਾਨੀਆਂ ਏ ਰਾਨਿਆ\nਬਾਰੂ ਨਵਾ ਅਭੀ ਕਨਿਆਂ ਏ ਰਾਨਿਆ', 'Maar Dihi Paala is a deeply evocative Bhojpuri song that captures the intensity of love, passion, and heartache within traditional folk imagery. The title itself, meaning \'kill me slowly,\' sets the tone for a narrative of emotional suffering caused by romantic entanglement. The song employs rich metaphors drawn from nature and the seasons, exploring themes of desire, betrayal, and the complexity of human relationships in the context of regional Indian culture.\n\nCulturally, Maar Dihi Paala reflects Bhojpuri traditions that blend rural sensibilities with sophisticated emotional expression. It speaks to universal themes of unrequited love and emotional turmoil while remaining rooted in specific regional poetic conventions and musical traditions.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 199, 3, 'published', 'Maar Dihi Paala Lyrics - Pawan Singh ft Neelam with Punjabi Translation - DjYoungster', 'Maar Dihi Paala lyrics bhojpuri star Pawan Singh featuring Neelam Giri (Bigg Boss 19 contestant) with English, Hindi, and Punjabi translations. Explore the meaning of \'Kill me slowly\' - a Bhojpuri folk song about love and heartache - DjYoungster', '/uploads/1770768338407-Maar-Dihi-Paala-Unknown-2026-20260112163104-500x500.webp', 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m3zIh6J_4HE', NULL, NULL, 'Prince Priyadarshi', 'Priyanshu Singh', 'Pawan Singh, Shilpi Raj', NULL, 'Neelam Giri', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-11 00:05:29.039', '2026-02-23 19:11:15.163', NULL, NULL),
('f21f1ca8-913f-4454-b1ef-c7c5dca9e738', 'Suhe Ve Vibe', 'suhe-ve-vibe', 'Suhe ve cheere waliyan main keniyan\nSuhe ve cheere waliyan main keniyan\nKar chhtri di chhav chhan mein beniyan\nLaddo nu vatna laavo saiyoo meri\nLaddo nu vatna aavo saiyoo\n\nSuhe ve cheere waliyan main keniyan\nSuhe ve cheere waliyan main keniyan\nKar chhatri di chhav chhan mein beniyan\nKar chhatri di chhav chhan mein beniyan\n\nDil selfie len da karda oye pout bana ke naal tere\nMain mood bana ke baithi ni yaar tu chhadd aaja kol mere\nMeri vibe nu match tu kar mundiyaan\nSuhe ve cheere waliyan main keniyan\nSuhe ve cheere waliyan main keniyan\nLarge bana do peg te milke peeniyan\n\nNasha tera daru varga\nKiller teri feel ve\nNasha tera daru varga\nKiller teri feel ve de doon tujhko sab kuch chahe\nHo jaun fakeer ve\nHo jaun fakeer ve\n\nMain tera suhe ve cheere waliya ye kenda aie\nKaranga chhatri di chhan ye wada karda aie\nMain tera suhe ve cheere waliya ye kenda aie\nKaranga chhatri di chhan ye wada karda aie\n\nSuhe ve cheere waliyan main keniyan\nMain tera suhe ve cheere waliya ye kenda aie\nKar chhatri di chhav chhan mein beniyan\nKaranga chhatri di chhan ye wada karda aie\n\nBharatlyrics.com is now on Facebook, Pinterest, Twitter and Instagram. Follow us and Stay Updated.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 10, 0, 'draft', 'Suhe Ve Vibe', NULL, 'https://bharatlyrics.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Suhe-Ve-Vibe.jpg', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Satya Khare', 'Sumeet Bellary', 'Gandharv Sachdev', 'ViaMonk Records', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-22 08:41:59.663', '2026-02-23 12:09:33.349', NULL, NULL),
('f22bd028-2a47-4fc7-a3ee-22281a2b9f71', 'Payaname', 'payaname', 'Yenno yennenno malupulu yenno yennenno maarpulu\nYenno yennenno pilupulu yenno yennenno talapulu\nNavvulu o chota raale puvvulu o chota\nJaare manase o chota gunde thadichenochota\n\nYeppudu vasthaamo mallee yennadu chusthaamo\nReppala maatuna daasthaamo akkade vidichi velthaamo\nHe yaa payaname saage ee payaname\nChere ye gamyame payaname payaname\n\nHe yaa payaname baagundhee payaname\nTaake ye thirame payaname payaname\nYe nimisham Io yemavuthundho\nYe majili yentha sepu nesthamavuthundho\n\nYevarevaro cheri parichayame maari\nDoorale kalipeti daaraalai\nDaggarake vacchi yegire rekkalane icchi\nKotha lokam chupinchi gnapakamaithaaru nacchi\n\nHe yaa payaname saage ee payaname\nChere ye gamyame payaname payaname\nHe yaa payaname baagundhee payaname\nTaake ye thirame payaname payaname\n\nMalli malli nee chirunavve yedapaine\nVaali seethaakokalavuthunte\nAtu viche gali itu vaipe thulli\nPedavula pai o paatai murisindhe\n\nUndaka o chota yemi thochaka o chota\nKaalam kadaladu ee poota artham kaadhe ee aata\nHe yaa payaname saage ee payaname\nChere ye gamyame payaname payaname\n\nHe yaa payaname baagundhee payaname\nTaake ye thirame payaname payaname', NULL, 'So many twists, so many turns,\nSo many changes, countless transformations.\nSo many calls, so many thoughts.\nSmiles rest in one place, flowers bloom in another,\nThe heart flows elsewhere, while the soul wets another space.\n\nWhen will we return? When will we meet again?\nWill we hide behind our eyelids, or leave everything behind right here?\nOh journey, you keep moving on,\nWhat destination do you finally lead us to?\n\nOh journey, you are beautiful,\nWhich shore will you finally touch?\nEvery moment is uncertain,\nEvery stop — how long will it remain a friend?\n\nStrangers meet and become memories,\nDistances turn into connecting paths.\nThey come close, gift us wings,\nShow us new worlds, and stay behind as sweet memories.\n\nAgain and again, your gentle smile leans on my heart,\nTurning into a resting butterfly.\nThe wind flows from there to here,\nBecoming a song that dances on my lips.\n\nStanding still somewhere, lost somewhere else,\nTime refuses to move at this moment.\nThis game of life makes no sense.\n\nOh journey, you keep moving on…\nWhich destination do you finally reach?', NULL, NULL, 'Payaname is a deeply philosophical song that treats life itself as a journey rather than a destination. It speaks about constant movement — emotional, physical, and spiritual — and how nothing in life stays fixed. The lyrics reflect the unpredictability of human existence, where emotions don’t always align with circumstances, and happiness appears in unexpected places. In essence, Payaname suggests that the beauty of life lies in the act of traveling, not arriving. Every moment, every person, every pause has meaning — even if we don’t understand it immediately. The song gently urges us to embrace uncertainty, cherish fleeting moments, and trust the journey.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 5600, 2, 'published', 'Payaname Lyrics (English Meaning) - Anup Rubens', 'Payaname Lyrics English Meaning & Translation - Anup Rubens. He yaa payaname saage ee payaname, Chere ye gamyame payaname payaname', '/uploads/1770043256060-downloaded.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Kasarla Shyam', 'Anup Rubens', NULL, 'Anup Rubens', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-02 14:41:07.266', '2026-02-23 20:50:43.989', NULL, NULL),
('f436f0be-e18c-4bb8-a2f1-eaf09c36e24e', 'Prabh Dori Haath Tumhare', 'prabh-dori-haath-tumhare', 'Prabh dori haath tumhaare\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\n\nSoi karaaye jo tudh bhaave\nMohe se aanp kachhu na aave\nSoi karaaye jo tudh bhaave\nMohe se aanp kachhu na aave\n\nHum baarik toh sharnaai\nPrabh aape paijar khaai\nHum baarik toh sharnaai\nPrabh aape paijar khaai\n\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\n\nMera maat pita Har raaya\nMaat pita Har raaya\nMera maat pita Har raaya\nMaat pita Har raaya\n\nKar kirpa prat paalan laagaa\nKar tera karaaya\nKar tera karaaya\nKar tera karaaya\n\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\n\nJee jant tere thaare\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\nJee jant tere thaare\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\n\nJe karaave so karnaa\nNanak daas teri sharnaa\nJe karaave so karnaa\nNanak daas teri sharnaa\n\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare\nPrabh dori haath tumhaare', NULL, 'O Lord, the strings are in Your hands,\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands.\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands,\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands.\n\nOnly that happens which pleases You;\nI myself am capable of nothing.\nOnly that happens which pleases You;\nI myself am capable of nothing.\n\nI am a child who has come to Your refuge;\nO Lord, You Yourself preserve my honor.\nI am a child who has come to Your refuge;\nO Lord, You Yourself preserve my honor.\n\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands,\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands.\n\nMy mother and father are the Lord King,\nMy mother and father are the Lord King.\nMy mother and father are the Lord King,\nMy mother and father are the Lord King.\n\nBy Your mercy, You nurture and protect me;\nEverything happens according to Your will.\nEverything happens according to Your will.\nEverything happens according to Your will.\n\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands,\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands.\n\nAll living beings belong to You;\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands.\nAll living beings belong to You;\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands.\n\nWhatever You cause to happen, that alone happens;\nServant Nanak seeks only Your refuge.\nWhatever You cause to happen, that alone happens;\nServant Nanak seeks only Your refuge.\n\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands,\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands,\nO Lord, the strings are in Your hands.', 'प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\nप्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\nप्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\nप्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\n\nसोइ कराए जो तुद पावे मोहे से आनपि कछु न आवे\nसोइ कराए जो तुद पावे मोहे से आनपि कछु न आवे\nहम बारिक तो शरणाई प्रभ आपे पैजर खाई\nहम बारिक तो शरणाई प्रभ आपे पैजर खाई\n\nप्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\nप्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\nमेरा मात पिता हर राया मात पिता हर राया\nमेरा मात पिता हर राया मात पिता हर राया\n\nकरि कृपा प्रति पालन लागा करि तेरा कराया\nकरि तेरा कराया करि तेरा कराया\nप्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\nप्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\n\nजी जंत तेरे थारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\nजी जंत तेरे थारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\nजे करावे सो करना नानक दास तेरी शरणा\nजे करावे सो करना नानक दास तेरी शरणा\n\nप्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\nप्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे\nप्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे प्रभ डोरी हाथ तुम्हारे', 'ਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\n\nਸੋਈ ਕਰਾਏ ਜੋ ਤੁਧੁ ਭਾਵੈ\nਮੋਹੇ ਸੇ ਆਨਪਿ ਕਛੁ ਨ ਆਵੈ\nਸੋਈ ਕਰਾਏ ਜੋ ਤੁਧੁ ਭਾਵੈ\nਮੋਹੇ ਸੇ ਆਨਪਿ ਕਛੁ ਨ ਆਵੈ\n\nਹਮ ਬਾਰਿਕ ਤਉ ਸਰਣਾਈ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਆਪੇ ਪੈਜਰ ਖਾਈ\nਹਮ ਬਾਰਿਕ ਤਉ ਸਰਣਾਈ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਆਪੇ ਪੈਜਰ ਖਾਈ\n\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\n\nਮੇਰਾ ਮਾਤ ਪਿਤਾ ਹਰਿ ਰਾਇਆ\nਮਾਤ ਪਿਤਾ ਹਰਿ ਰਾਇਆ\nਮੇਰਾ ਮਾਤ ਪਿਤਾ ਹਰਿ ਰਾਇਆ\nਮਾਤ ਪਿਤਾ ਹਰਿ ਰਾਇਆ\n\nਕਰਿ ਕਿਰਪਾ ਪ੍ਰਤਿ ਪਾਲਨ ਲਾਗਾ\nਕਰਿ ਤੇਰਾ ਕਰਾਇਆ\nਕਰਿ ਤੇਰਾ ਕਰਾਇਆ\nਕਰਿ ਤੇਰਾ ਕਰਾਇਆ\n\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\n\nਜੀ ਜੰਤ ਤੇਰੇ ਥਾਰੇ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\nਜੀ ਜੰਤ ਤੇਰੇ ਥਾਰੇ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\n\nਜੇ ਕਰਾਵੈ ਸੋ ਕਰਣਾ\nਨਾਨਕ ਦਾਸ ਤੇਰੀ ਸਰਣਾ\nਜੇ ਕਰਾਵੈ ਸੋ ਕਰਣਾ\nਨਾਨਕ ਦਾਸ ਤੇਰੀ ਸਰਣਾ\n\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ\nਪ੍ਰਭ ਡੋਰੀ ਹਾਥ ਤੁਮ੍ਹਾਰੇ', 'Prabh Dori Haath Tumhare is a deeply surrendering Shabad that expresses complete trust in the Divine. The central message is simple yet profound: human beings are not in control everything moves according to the will of the Lord. Just as a puppet moves only when its strings are pulled, life unfolds only as God commands.\n\nThe Shabad reflects humility. The devotee openly admits personal helplessness and accepts that all actions, outcomes, and directions come solely from the Divine. This is not spoken with fear, but with peace. There is comfort in knowing that responsibility no longer rests on the self it rests with God.', NULL, NULL, 2026, 1, 5641, 2, 'published', 'Prabh Dori Haath Tumhare Shabad Lyrics with English Translation', '“Prabh dori haath tumhaare…” Read the complete Gurbani Shabad lyrics of Prabh Dori Haath Tumhare with Roman text and English translation, a powerful hymn of surrender and faith beautifully rendered by Vir Dilbag Singh Ji.', '/uploads/1770131771878-downloaded.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Traditional', 'Bhai Surinder Singh', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-03 15:16:51.708', '2026-02-23 20:50:27.551', NULL, NULL);
