('f63052bb-6763-4d4e-95aa-29ec7014393a', 'Cute Jahi smile', 'cute-jahi-smile', 'Cute jehi smile wale velia\nKhand wargi tu patt le gaya\nNaale jeet layi uni di pradhangi\nNaale dil mera jeet le gaya\n\nBade ladan naal maapeyan ne paali\nMain ho bade ladan naal maapeyan ne paali\nMain kudi saab saab paeni rakhni\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere rakhna\nTere naal ni koi hor babbni\n\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere rakhna\nTere naal nahi koi hor babbni\n\nNoor chehre utte nooran bina chadh je\nTu jadon maan naal hath mera pharda\nKithe lagge na nazar saadi jodi nu\nTu gallan nainan vichon meriyan tan pharda\n\nNoor chehre utte doona peena chadh je\nTu jadon maan naal hath mera pharda\nKithe lagge na nazar saadi jodi nu\nTu gallan nainan vichon meriyan tan phar le\n\nHun chhad de tu bhull na ve addiyan ho\nHun chhad de tu bhull na ve addiyan\nSidha ho ke kara mangni koi sohna laggna ni\nMere naal khada tere naal ni\nKoi hor babbni\n\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere naal khada\nTere naal vi ni hor babbni\n\nTeriyan tan just friends si\nKarde block hun saariyan\nIk vaar aakhan gall mann liya kar\nNa maithon fir karaya kar baliyaan teriyan\n\nJo just friends si karde block hun\nSaariyan ik vaar aakhan gall badliya kar na\nMaithon firtaan karaya kar baliyaan\n\nMain tera injh vi nahi share kar sakdi\nHo main tera inch vi nahi share kar sakdi\nTeri aakad vi pai ni challni\n\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere rakhna\nTere naal vi ni hor babbni\n\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere rakhna\nTere naal vi ni hor babbni\n\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere rakhna\nTere naal vi ni hor babbni hun', 'Cute jehi smile wale velia\nKhand wargi tu patt le gaya\nNaale jeet layi uni di pradhangi\nNaale dil mera jeet le gaya\n\nBade ladan naal maapeyan ne paali\nMain ho bade ladan naal maapeyan ne paali\nMain kudi saab saab paeni rakhni\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere rakhna\nTere naal ni koi hor babbni\n\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere rakhna\nTere naal nahi koi hor babbni\n\nNoor chehre utte nooran bina chadh je\nTu jadon maan naal hath mera pharda\nKithe lagge na nazar saadi jodi nu\nTu gallan nainan vichon meriyan tan pharda\n\nNoor chehre utte doona peena chadh je\nTu jadon maan naal hath mera pharda\nKithe lagge na nazar saadi jodi nu\nTu gallan nainan vichon meriyan tan phar le\n\nHun chhad de tu bhull na ve addiyan ho\nHun chhad de tu bhull na ve addiyan\nSidha ho ke kara mangni koi sohna laggna ni\nMere naal khada tere naal ni\nKoi hor babbni\n\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere naal khada\nTere naal vi ni hor babbni\n\nTeriyan tan just friends si\nKarde block hun saariyan\nIk vaar aakhan gall mann liya kar\nNa maithon fir karaya kar baliyaan teriyan\n\nJo just friends si karde block hun\nSaariyan ik vaar aakhan gall badliya kar na\nMaithon firtaan karaya kar baliyaan\n\nMain tera injh vi nahi share kar sakdi\nHo main tera inch vi nahi share kar sakdi\nTeri aakad vi pai ni challni\n\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere rakhna\nTere naal vi ni hor babbni\n\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere rakhna\nTere naal vi ni hor babbni\n\nKoi sohna laggna ni mere rakhna\nTere naal vi ni hor babbni hun', 'Those with a cute little smile\nYou took away someone sweet like sugar\nAlso won the university presidency\nAnd also stole my heart\n\nRaised with great effort by parents\nI, also raised with great effort by parents\nI must keep the girl protected\nNo one looks good with me\nNo one else fits with you\n\nNo one looks good with me\nNo one else fits with you\n\nLight on the face shines without needing more\nWhen you hold my hand proudly\nMay no evil gaze fall on our pair\nYou communicate without words from your eyes\n\nLight on the face shines even more\nWhen you hold my hand proudly\nMay no evil gaze fall on our pair\nYou communicate through the eyes, my expressions\n\nNow stop remembering foolish things\nNow stop remembering foolish things\nProperly propose, no one looks good\nStanding with me next to you\nNo one else fits\n\nNo one looks good standing beside me\nNobody else stands with you\n\nThey were just friends, now blocked them all\nOnce