('22e9b9db-15a9-4fe1-a59b-6068316d1da8', 'Shyam Baba Bhajan', 'shyam-baba-bhajan', '2026-01-30 07:28:11.473', 'Welcome to the Shyam Baba Bhajan Lyrics section on DJYoungster, your ultimate destination for the latest Khatu Shyam devotional song lyrics in 2026. Discover accurate lyrics of Shyam Bhajan, Khatu Naresh songs, Shyam Aarti, Shyam Chalisa, and Barbarik Bhajan with translations and spiritual meaning.', 'Explore Shyam Baba Bhajan lyrics 2026 on DJYoungster. Find latest Khatu Shyam songs, Shyam Aarti, Shyam Chalisa & Barbarik Bhajan with translations and meaning.', 'Shyam Baba Bhajan Lyrics 2026 - Khatu Shyam | DJYoungster'),
