('6f281dfb-1269-495a-9386-e032734ecdda', 'religious', 'religious', '2026-01-28 10:50:11.775', 'Welcome to the Religious Lyrics section on DJYoungster, your ultimate destination for the latest spiritual song lyrics in 2026. Discover accurate lyrics of Bhajan, Aarti, Shabad, Gurbani, Sufi, Qawwali, and devotional songs from all faiths in Hindi, Punjabi, and regional languages with translations and meaning.', 'Explore Religious song lyrics 2026 on DJYoungster. Find latest Bhajan, Shabad, Sufi, Qawwali & spiritual song lyrics in Hindi, Punjabi with translations & meaning.', 'Religious Song Lyrics 2026 - Spiritual Hits | DJYoungster'),
