('82cabb35-234f-4883-b685-0424fffd6662', 'hindu bhajan', 'hindu-bhajan', '2026-01-28 10:50:00.494', 'Welcome to the Hindu Bhajan Lyrics section on DJYoungster, your ultimate destination for the latest devotional song lyrics in 2026. Discover accurate lyrics of Bhajan, Aarti, Chalisa, Mantra, and Stuti dedicated to Lord Krishna, Shiva, Ganesh, Ram, Hanuman, and Mata Rani with translations and spiritual meaning.', 'Explore Hindu Bhajan lyrics 2026 on DJYoungster. Find latest Bhajan, Aarti, Chalisa & devotional song lyrics of Krishna, Shiva, Ganesh, Ram & Hanuman with meaning.', 'Hindu Bhajan Lyrics 2026 - Devotional Songs | DJYoungster'),
