('c2da445e-fd9e-4c12-839b-9eb5134eabfe', 'Jatt', 'jatt', '2026-01-28 08:14:30.547', 'Welcome to the Jatt Songs Lyrics section on DJYoungster, your ultimate destination for the latest Jatt song lyrics in 2026. Discover accurate lyrics of Jatt anthems, Attitude songs, Desi tracks, and Punjabi Jatt hits from top artists with Hindi translations and romanized text.', 'Explore Jatt song lyrics 2026 on DJYoungster. Find latest Jatt hits, Punjabi Jatt songs, Attitude tracks & Party anthems with translations and complete lyrics.', 'Jatt Song Lyrics 2026 - Latest Punjabi | DJYoungster'),
