('ca78858c-1015-4441-b5bf-cf5b59dfc400', 'dharmik', 'dharmik', '2026-01-28 10:49:50.010', 'Welcome to the Dharmik Lyrics section on DJYoungster, your ultimate destination for the latest religious and spiritual song lyrics in 2026. Discover accurate lyrics of Bhajan, Aarti, Chalisa, Shabad, Kirtan, and devotional songs in Hindi, Punjabi, and regional languages with translations and meaning.', 'Explore Dharmik song lyrics 2026 on DJYoungster. Find latest Bhajan, Aarti, Chalisa, Shabad & spiritual song lyrics in Hindi, Punjabi with translations & meaning.', 'Dharmik Song Lyrics 2026 - Bhajan & Aarti | DJYoungster'),
